    # cia "No confirmed name. Lone operator. Mercenary. Assassin."
    cia "身份未经确认，单独行动，雇佣兵，刺客。"

# game/script.rpy:648
translate Chinese po01_Con_1_afd7c07a:

    # cia "Every time she's reported in the area, we find bodies."
    cia "每次有她在那一带活动的消息，接着就会发现尸体。"

# game/script.rpy:649
translate Chinese po01_Con_1_70ae3baf:

    # cia "Our people. Russian troops. ALF fighters."
    cia "我们的人，俄军，ALF武装分子。"

# game/script.rpy:650
translate Chinese po01_Con_1_8854af9d:

    # cia "She shoots everyone."
    cia "她照杀不误。"

