translate Chinese po01_Con_2_b0a5b8b8:

    # ev "Yes, it's me. Who else would it be? You're supposed to take me to school, remember? Or are you just planning to sleep all day?"
    ev "对啊，不然还能是谁？今天该你送我去上学，记得吗？还是说你打算睡一整天？"

# game/script.rpy:1144
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_e9fecbbe:

    # wi "Yeah, yeah, I'm up. Just... give me a sec."
    wi "起来了，起来了。就……等我一下。"

# game/script.rpy:1145
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_37e6179e:

    # ev "You okay? You looked like you were having that dream again."
    ev "你还好吗？你看起来好像又做那个梦了。"

# game/script.rpy:1146
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_a3108b72:

    # wi "It was just... another dream. Nothing I can't handle."
    wi "只是……又一个梦，我扛得住。"

# game/script.rpy:1147
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_90f309df:

    # ev "You sure? You were thrashing around like a zombie. Anyway, you promised you'd take me to school today, so hurry up!"
    ev "你确定？刚才你挣得跟丧尸似的。反正说好了今天送我上学，快点！"

