# game/script.rpy:1163
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_2fe4325b:

    # wio "My name's Will. It's been a while since I was discharged from the military... eight months, to be exact."
    wio "我叫威尔。从部队退役已经有一阵子了……准确来说是八个月。"

# game/script.rpy:1165
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_522eba7b:

    # wio "That's Evelyn, my little sister. We've been living together, just the two of us."
    wio "那是伊芙琳，我的妹妹。我们俩就这么相依为命地住在一起。"

# game/script.rpy:1167
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_7ee0a36c:

    # wio "There's a big age gap between us, but we've always been close."
    wio "我们年龄差挺大的，但一直很亲近。"

# game/script.rpy:1169
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_e882e0e1:

    # wio "After our parents died, I left the military to take care of her."
    wio "父母去世后，我离开了部队来照顾她。"

# game/script.rpy:1171
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_e25c8e1a:

    # wio "We've got enough money to get by, but... yeah, I've been drifting. No work, just... living day by day."
    wio "钱倒是够花，但……唉，我一直在飘着。没工作，就这么一天天熬。"

# game/script.rpy:1173
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_da40fcd8:

    # ev "The internet's been down since last night. I need to finish downloading my presentation. It's not like I was just scrolling through DikDok, you know?"
    ev "网络从昨晚就断了，我得把报告下载完。我可不是在刷DikDok，你知道的吧？"

# game/script.rpy:1175
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_63c4b082:

    # wi "Uh-huh, sure. Not scrolling through DikDok, huh? So what were you doing? Watching those cat videos again?"
    wi "嗯哼，是啊。没在刷DikDok？那你在干嘛？又在看猫咪视频？"

# game/script.rpy:1177
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_1b2578e6:

    # ev "Haha... No! I was actually working, thank you very much. My project's due today. And if you make me late, I'll make sure everyone knows you're the reason I failed."
    ev "哈哈……才没有！我在认真做作业，谢谢。我的项目今天就截止了。你要是害我迟到，我就告诉所有人，是我哥害我没交上。"

# game/script.rpy:1179
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_06cfe922:

    # wi "You'll be fine. And besides, you always ace those presentations."
    wi "你会没事的，而且你每次报告都拿高分。"

# game/script.rpy:1181
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_76e58b4a:

    # ev "Only if I can finish it. Thanks to the non-existent Wi-Fi, I'm stuck here."
    ev "前提是我能做完。多亏了这根本不存在的Wi-Fi，我现在卡在这儿了。"

# game/script.rpy:1182
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_74649e49:

    # ev "By the way... have you thought about going to see a therapist again?"
    ev "对了……你有没有想过再去看看心理医生？"

# game/script.rpy:1184
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_1e84f44e:

    # wi "I'm fine. Been fine for a while now. Just had another weird dream, that's all."
    wi "我没事，已经好一阵子了。就是又做了个奇怪的梦而已。"

# game/script.rpy:1186
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_c61da7e5:

    # ev "You still have those dreams, Will. That's not fine."
    ev "你还是老做那些梦，威尔。这可不叫没事。"

# game/script.rpy:1188
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_64eaefb4:

    # wi "It's nothing, Evie. Really."
    wi "真没什么，伊薇，真的。"

# game/script.rpy:1190
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_e5669ac6:

    # ev "Whatever you say. Just don't make me late. I've got a presentation today, remember?"
    ev "随你怎么说吧。别害我迟到就行，我今天有报告，记得吧？"

# game/script.rpy:1192
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_6b54bebb:

    # wi "Yeah, yeah. Oh, and by the way, we're out of food. Fridge's empty. So, I guess breakfast is gonna have to be in town."
    wi "好好好。……对了，家里没吃的了，冰箱是空的。早饭大概只能去镇上解决。"

# game/script.rpy:1193
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_80b314c6:

    # ev "Works for me. Let's go before you space out again."
    ev "没问题，趁你还没又走神，赶紧走吧。"

