# game/script.rpy:1217
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_17ef95d1:

    # wi "So, what's the plan after school? Gonna binge-watch something if the Wi-Fi ever comes back?"
    wi "那放学以后有什么打算？要是Wi-Fi恢复了，是不是又要刷剧刷一整天？"

# game/script.rpy:1219
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_8b95fe11:

    # ev "Yeah, sure. If it ever works again! I'm not even hoping at this point."
    ev "是啊，如果它还能恢复的话！我现在都不抱希望了。"

# game/script.rpy:1221
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_55d1ab82:

    # wi "Well, until then, you can always rewatch those old DVDs, right? Remember, we still have those."
    wi "那在这之前，你还可以重看那些旧DVD啊，记得吧，我们还留着呢。"

# game/script.rpy:1223
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_4c3f3ea5:

    # ev "Oh god, no! Not those cheesy movies again. I'd rather read a book... okay, maybe not a book."
    ev "天啊，不要！别再看那些烂片了。我宁愿看书……好吧，也许书也不行。"

# game/script.rpy:1225
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_046e50f8:

    # wi "See? Life isn't all bad. You'll survive a day or two without Wi-Fi."
    wi "看吧？生活也没那么糟嘛，没有Wi-Fi你也能撑个一两天。"

# game/script.rpy:1226
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_99af7598:

    # ev "Ha, barely! But yeah, I guess I'll manage."
    ev "哈，勉强吧！不过好吧，我应该能应付过去。"

# game/script.rpy:1229
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_0ae9bcd0_16:

    # ""
    ""

# game/script.rpy:1233
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_5be3963c:

    # wi "So, how's the presentation? Still feeling good about it?"
    wi "那报告准备得怎么样？还有信心吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1235
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_14f7e68d:

    # ev "Honestly? I'd feel a lot better if the internet wasn't down! I couldn't finish my research, and now I'm just... winging it."
    ev "说实话？要是网络没断我会更有信心！我资料都没查完，现在只能……硬着头皮上了。"

# game/script.rpy:1237
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_025fbe1f:

    # wi "You've still got your notes though, right? You'll do fine."
    wi "你不是还有笔记吗？你会没事的。"

# game/script.rpy:1239
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_e5d09938:

    # ev "Notes? Yeah, but they're not enough. I was supposed to download all these extra resources. Now I'm going in blind."
    ev "笔记？有是有，但不够啊。我本来还要下载好多补充资料的，现在只能两眼一抹黑上场了。"

# game/script.rpy:1241
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_0cca5152:

    # wi "Hey, you're resourceful. You've always pulled it off before."
    wi "嘿，你脑子活，之前每次都能应付过去。"

# game/script.rpy:1243
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_a3f149a6:

    # ev "Yeah, but this feels different. I hate not being fully prepared."
    ev "是啊，但这次感觉不一样，我最讨厌准备不充分。"

# game/script.rpy:1246
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_0ae9bcd0_17:

    # ""
