# game/script.rpy:1257
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_de763d13:

    # wi "You know, back when I was your age, there wasn't any of this internet stuff."
    wi "你知道吗，我像你这么大的时候，根本没有网络这种东西。"

# game/script.rpy:1258
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_f8ffc7c0:

    # wi "If I wanted to pass the time, I had to actually go outside and do things. Real things."
    wi "想打发时间，就得真的出去做点事，实实在在的事。"

# game/script.rpy:1259
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_745d1730:

    # ev "Like what, ride dinosaurs?"
    ev "比如说，骑恐龙？"

# game/script.rpy:1260
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_f60fc559:

    # wi "No, but close. Dad used to take me out every weekend. Camping, fishing, you name it. Once, we tried to build a treehouse in the backyard."
    wi "不是，但也差不多了。老爸以前每个周末都会带我出去，露营、钓鱼，什么都干过。有一次我们还试着在后院搭个树屋。"

# game/script.rpy:1261
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_45fc99b8:

    # wi "I thought it was going to be this epic two-story hideout... Spoiler alert, it collapsed in on itself after a week."
    wi "我当时还指望那会是个了不起的两层秘密基地……剧透一下：撑了一个星期，自己塌了。"

# game/script.rpy:1262
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_377a472e:

    # ev "Sounds like your engineering skills haven't improved much."
    ev "听起来你的工程技术这么多年也没什么长进。"

# game/script.rpy:1263
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_187813c1:

    # wi "Yeah, I wasn't exactly cut out for construction. But Dad... he was always patient with me. He'd let me hammer nails into wood, even when I was doing it all wrong."
    wi "是啊，我确实不是搞建筑的料。但老爸……他一直很有耐心，就算我把钉子钉得乱七八糟，他也让我继续钉。"

# game/script.rpy:1264
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_b83fe3ce:

    # ev "He sounds like he was a really great dad."
    ev "听起来他真是个很棒的爸爸。"

# game/script.rpy:1265
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_403fe44c:

    # wi "He was. He had this way of making the simplest things feel like the biggest adventures. I remember this one time, we went fishing in that old lake near the cabin."
    wi "确实。他总有办法把最简单的事变成最大的冒险。我记得有一次，我们去小屋附近那个老湖钓鱼。"

# game/script.rpy:1266
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_898495ab:

    # wi "I must've been about 10. We didn't catch a single fish, but Dad made it feel like we were out there on some grand expedition."
    wi "我那年大概十岁。一条鱼都没钓着，但老爸愣是弄得像我们正在进行一次盛大的远征。"

# game/script.rpy:1268
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_01b38438:

    # wi "We spent hours just sitting in that little rowboat, talking about everything—life, the stars, what I wanted to be when I grew up."
    wi "我们就坐在那条小木船上聊了好几个小时——聊人生，聊星星，聊我长大后想做什么。"

# game/script.rpy:1269
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_34a93325:

    # wi "He never got mad when I messed up or got bored. He just... he just enjoyed being with me."
    wi "就算我搞砸了或者觉得无聊，他也从不生气。他只是……只是单纯享受跟我在一起的时光。"

# game/script.rpy:1270
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_32688a4e:

    # ev "I wish I could've known him like that."
    ev "真希望我也能这样了解他。"

# game/script.rpy:1272
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_f664d817:

    # wi "You know, when you were born, I remember Dad was over the moon. He would carry you everywhere, even when you started getting too heavy for his back."
    wi "你知道吗，你出生的时候，老爸开心得不得了。他到哪儿都抱着你，就算后来你都重得他背不动了也一样。"

# game/script.rpy:1273
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_d7c9bd74:

    # wi "He'd joke about how you were going to be smarter than me one day."
    wi "他还开玩笑说，总有一天你会比我聪明。"

# game/script.rpy:1274
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_698bc818:

    # wi "Sometimes... I still hear him. In the back of my mind, whenever I mess something up or don't know what to do, I think about what he'd say. It's like he's still there, guiding me."
    wi "有时候……在心底最深处，我还能听见他的声音。每次我搞砸了、或者不知道该怎么办，就会想他会怎么说。就好像他还在那儿，还在给我指路。"

# game/script.rpy:1275
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_dab79175:

    # ev "He was gone a lot when I was little. I don't remember him being home much."
    ev "我小时候他经常不在家，我都不太记得他在家的样子了。"

# game/script.rpy:1276
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_363bebca:

    # wi "Yeah... I guess you wouldn't. But before that, he was... he was different. He loved spending time with us, but as the money came in, he started drifting away."
    wi "嗯……你确实不太记得。但在那之前，他……他不是这样的。他很喜欢陪着我们，但后来家里有了收入，他就渐渐疏远了。"

# game/script.rpy:1277
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_0b3d47ef:

    # ev "Do you think about him a lot?"
    ev "你经常想起他吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1278
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_665b27c4:

    # wi "Yeah, especially now... talking about all this... it makes me miss him."
    wi "是啊，尤其是现在……聊起这些……让我很想他。"

# game/script.rpy:1279
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_1e3e7e3c:

    # ev "Me too, Will."
    ev "我也是，威尔。"

