translate Chinese po01_Con_2_f342ecf3:

    # ev "She's fine, just her foot. But I'm more worried about everything else going on."
    ev "她没事，就脚有点问题。不过我更担心其他的事。"

# game/script.rpy:1891
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_bf799c57:

    # wi "Let me take a look at that."
    wi "让我看看。"

# game/script.rpy:1893
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_f6f5ad5e:

    # wi "You know, Beth, wearing heels in a zombie apocalypse might not be the best idea."
    wi "话说，贝丝，在丧尸末日里穿高跟鞋，可能不是什么好主意。"

# game/script.rpy:1895
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_39f5297c:

    # be "Oh, come on! I wanted to look good for the day. Who knew we'd be running from zombies?"
    be "哎呀拜托！我只是想今天打扮得好看点，谁知道今天得逃命啊？"

# game/script.rpy:1897
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_273dc561:

    # wi "Well, if you're planning to outrun a zombie, maybe flats would've been a smarter choice."
    wi "那如果你打算跑赢丧尸，也许平底鞋才是明智之选。"

# game/script.rpy:1899
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_735008b5:

    # be "Too late for that now! Besides, I'm tough. I can handle a little pain."
    be "现在说这个也晚了！再说了，我挺坚强的，一点疼痛我能忍。"

# game/script.rpy:1901
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_89978814:

    # wi "Yeah, but it's a lot easier to run without wobbling on those stilettos."
    wi "是啊，但不用踩着细高跟摇摇晃晃地跑，肯定容易多了。"

# game/script.rpy:1903
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_679f118c:

    # ev "Next time, Beth, go for the sneakers! We need you quick on your feet!"
    ev "下次啊，贝丝，穿运动鞋吧！我们需要你脚下利索点！"

# game/script.rpy:1905
translate Chinese po01_Con_2_a72f7a89:

    # be "Okay, okay! Note taken. Just keep us safe, Will, and I'll reconsider my shoe choices in the future."
    be "好啦好啦，我记住了。你只要保护好我们，威尔，我以后会重新考虑穿什么鞋。"

