# game/script.rpy:3425
translate Chinese po02_01_56f42c74:

    # wi "Used to be. I've been out for almost a year."
    wi "曾经是，我退伍快一年了。"

# game/script.rpy:3427
translate Chinese po02_01_2326034c:

    # aj "Man, you don't look like no soldier."
    aj "老兄，你看着一点都不像当兵的。"

# game/script.rpy:3428
translate Chinese po02_01_960fa353:

    # aj "With that haircut, I figured you were some streamer or some shit."
    aj "就那发型，我还以为你是什么主播之类的。"

# game/script.rpy:3430
translate Chinese po02_01_56527dbd:

    # wi "Nah. There's a reason I keep it this way."
    wi "不是，我留这发型是有原因的。"

# game/script.rpy:3432
translate Chinese po02_01_191f7e6d:

    # aj "Aight... that explains the whole quiet-ass thing."
    aj "行吧……这就能解释你这么闷了。"

# game/script.rpy:3434
translate Chinese po02_01_ca1d4c0a:

    # aj "Damn... We got ourselves a damn squad now."
    aj "该死……咱们这算是凑齐一支队伍了。"

# game/script.rpy:3435
translate Chinese po02_01_31e8b572:

    # aj "We got the shooter..."
    aj "有神枪手……"

# game/script.rpy:3436
translate Chinese po02_01_41c01f52:

    # aj "And the cowboy sniper."
    aj "还有牛仔狙击手。"

# game/script.rpy:3438
translate Chinese po02_01_23e28f6b:

    # du "Cowboy sniper?"
    du "牛仔狙击手？"

# game/script.rpy:3440
translate Chinese po02_01_0bf64a86:

    # aj "Yeah. Look at you."
    aj "对啊，你看看你自己。"

# game/script.rpy:3441
translate Chinese po02_01_0c44a9ff:

    # aj "All quiet and shit, carrying that rifle like you came straight outta Texas."
    aj "闷不吭声，扛着那把步枪，跟刚从德克萨斯州走出来似的。"

# game/script.rpy:3443
translate Chinese po02_01_f1b10e5e:

    # du "Well, hell..."
    du "好家伙……"

# game/script.rpy:3445
translate Chinese po02_01_34353813:

    # aj "And when I get a gun... we got the motherfuckin' problem."
    aj "等我拿到枪……那咱们可就有大麻烦了。"

# game/script.rpy:3447
translate Chinese po02_01_7d37e92c:

    # du "Well, least you know what you are."
    du "好歹你自己清楚自己是啥样。"

# game/script.rpy:3449
translate Chinese po02_01_19173e07:

    # aj "See? Cowboy gets me."
    aj "瞧见没？牛仔懂我。"

# game/script.rpy:3451
translate Chinese po02_01_8610d908:

    # wi "Are you two always like this?"
    wi "你们俩一直都这样吗？"

# game/script.rpy:3453
translate Chinese po02_01_1c8ed817:

    # aj "We just met, bro. Give it time."
    aj "咱们才刚认识，兄弟，给点时间。"

# game/script.rpy:3455
translate Chinese po02_01_ca949ff7:

    # du "Lord help us."
    du "老天保佑。"

# game/script.rpy:3468
translate Chinese po02_01_0ae9bcd0_108:

    # ""
    ""

# game/script.rpy:3470
translate Chinese po02_01_64aa93a5:

    # wi "Mag's almost dry. I've got one magazine left."
    wi "弹匣快空了，我只剩一个弹匣了。"

# game/script.rpy:3473
translate Chinese po02_01_0ae9bcd0_109:

    # ""
    ""

# game/script.rpy:3475
translate Chinese po02_01_2e9c159d:

    # aj "Ah, hell... don't tell me that. Damn, soldier boy sayin' ammo's runnin' out? That's bad luck, man."
    aj "靠……别告诉我这个。当兵的居然说弹药要没了？这兆头可不好啊。"

# game/script.rpy:3477
translate Chinese po02_01_204f4750:

    # wi "One mag. Make it count."
    wi "一个弹匣，得省着点用。"

