# game/script.rpy:3642
translate Chinese po02_01_2f2a0272:

    # wi "They're falling back. Line's collapsing. That's containment failing."
    wi "他们在后撤，防线在崩溃，围堵已经失败了。"

# game/script.rpy:3644
translate Chinese po02_01_6c8e2d06:

    # du "Ain't just the numbers either. Look how damn fast those things move."
    du "还不只是数量的问题，你看那些东西跑得多快。"

# game/script.rpy:3645
translate Chinese po02_01_35c83fed:

    # du "Soon as that line cracks... Whole street's gonna drown in 'em."
    du "防线一旦破了……整条街都会被它们淹没。"

# game/script.rpy:3647
translate Chinese po02_01_4ac98c9b:

    # aj "Man... this shit ugly. And we sittin' right above the damn buffet."
    aj "老天……情况太糟了，咱们还正好坐在自助餐上头。"

# game/script.rpy:3648
translate Chinese po02_01_0ccd6320:

    # aj "Soon as them things look up?"
    aj "等那些东西一抬头？"

# game/script.rpy:3649
translate Chinese po02_01_3bbd1d64:

    # aj "Yeah... we fucked."
    aj "嗯……咱们就完了。"

# game/script.rpy:3651
translate Chinese po02_01_59b270cc:

    # be "Sun's going down. Visibility's about to drop, and when that happens, panic spreads fast."
    be "太阳要下山了，能见度马上就会变差，到时候恐慌会蔓延得很快。"

# game/script.rpy:3653
translate Chinese po02_01_5d6f4e05:

    # be "We should probably head down and find somewhere safer, Will."
    be "我们大概该下去找个更安全的地方了，威尔。"

# game/script.rpy:3655
translate Chinese po02_01_999d991a:

    # aj "Hold up... You sayin' we go down there? Through all that crazy shit?"
    aj "等等……你是说要下去？穿过那一片乱七八糟的东西？"

# game/script.rpy:3657
translate Chinese po02_01_5cd98481:

    # be "I'm saying staying here isn't a strategy. It's delay. Until something worse finds us."
    be "我是说留在这儿不算策略，只是在拖时间，拖到更糟的东西找上门为止。"

