# game/script.rpy:3671
translate Chinese po02_01_77b2d44d:

    # be "Will..."
    be "威尔……"

# game/script.rpy:3673
translate Chinese po02_01_a9b03883:

    # wi "She's right. Up here we're exposed. No cover, no supplies, no way out."
    wi "她说得对，我们在这上面完全暴露，没有掩护，没有补给，也没有退路。"

# game/script.rpy:3675
translate Chinese po02_01_0ae9bcd0_148:

    # ""
    ""

# game/script.rpy:3677
translate Chinese po02_01_1e2929ce:

    # du "Inside that building though... we might find a room we can hole up in. One door. One kill zone."
    du "不过那栋楼里面……说不定能找个守得住的房间，一扇门，一个杀伤区。"

# game/script.rpy:3679
translate Chinese po02_01_79f65b0c:

    # aj "Yeah... assumin' that place ain't already packed with them damn things."
    aj "是啊……前提是那地方还没被那些玩意儿塞满。"

# game/script.rpy:3682
translate Chinese po02_01_0ae9bcd0_149:

    # ""
    ""

# game/script.rpy:3684
translate Chinese po02_01_bc764f0b:

    # wi "If that line breaks... this whole block collapses. Fast."
    wi "要是防线破了……这整个街区很快就会沦陷。"

# game/script.rpy:3686
translate Chinese po02_01_5e711973:

    # du "Then we best move before it does."
    du "那咱们最好在那之前动身。"

# game/script.rpy:3688
translate Chinese po02_01_8a460670:

    # aj "Aight. So who the hell goin' first?"
    aj "行吧，那到底谁先上？"

# game/script.rpy:3690
translate Chinese po02_01_f53ea517:

    # wi "I am... Quick sweep, find somewhere we can hold."
    wi "我先去……快速搜一遍，找个能守住的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:3692
translate Chinese po02_01_77b2d44d_1:

    # be "Will..."
    be "威尔……"

# game/script.rpy:3693
translate Chinese po02_01_79c9115a:

    # wi "Someone has to. That's me. And I've done this before."
    wi "总得有人去，那就是我，而且我以前干过这个。"

# game/script.rpy:3697
translate Chinese po02_01_0ae9bcd0_150:

    # ""
    ""

# game/script.rpy:3699
translate Chinese po02_01_cc00517f:

    # pomav "If anyone can hear this, proceed immediately to The Empire Mall."
    pomav "如果有人能听到，请立即前往帝国商场。"

# game/script.rpy:3701
translate Chinese po02_01_633d26ee:

    # pomav "Repeat... The Empire Mall. Evacuation in progress."
    pomav "重复……帝国商场，疏散行动正在进行中。"

# game/script.rpy:3704
translate Chinese po02_01_0ae9bcd0_151:

    # ""
    ""

# game/script.rpy:3706
translate Chinese po02_01_5fc94e5d:

    # yu "The Empire...? That's across the city."
    yu "帝国商场……？那在城市的另一头。"

# game/script.rpy:3708
translate Chinese po02_01_c5278602:

    # aj "Man, hell nah... That ain't around the corner, that's damn near the other side of the city."
    aj "老天，不是吧……那可不是拐个弯就到，几乎是城市另一头了。"

# game/script.rpy:3710
translate Chinese po02_01_323aa1a0:

    # be "Crossing the city right now? That's suicide."
    be "现在穿越整座城市？那是自杀。"

# game/script.rpy:3712
translate Chinese po02_01_38256e95:

    # aj "Man, finally somebody said it."
    aj "老天，终于有人说出来了。"

# game/script.rpy:3714
translate Chinese po02_01_07a8703a:

    # wi "Empire's the destination. But we're not making that run tonight."
    wi "帝国商场是目的地，但今晚我们不走这一趟。"

# game/script.rpy:3716
translate Chinese po02_01_8d108840:

    # du "Roads down there look like hell. Military's barely holdin' as it is."
    du "下面的路简直跟地狱似的，军方现在都快撑不住了。"

# game/script.rpy:3718
translate Chinese po02_01_391daab2:

    # aj "My girl's LSPD. She could be over there."
    aj "我女朋友在洛斯苏埃诺斯警局工作。"

# game/script.rpy:3720
translate Chinese po02_01_cbed6003:

    # du "You got a cop for a girlfriend?"
    du "你女朋友是警察？"

# game/script.rpy:3721
translate Chinese po02_01_a08b636a:

    # du "Lord have mercy... she must be one patient woman."
    du "老天保佑……那她肯定是个特别有耐心的女人。"

# game/script.rpy:3722
translate Chinese po02_01_5ff2c079:

    # aj "Man, she crazy enough to put up with me."
    aj "老天，她能受得了我，也是够疯的了。"

# game/script.rpy:3724
translate Chinese po02_01_4d20bb3f:

    # wi "Step one, we survive the night. Tomorrow... we figure out how to cross this city."
    wi "第一步，我们先撑过今晚。明天……再想办法穿越这座城市。"

# game/script.rpy:3726
translate Chinese po02_01_a858eae1:

    # aj "Yeah. Step one? Don't die."
    aj "嗯，第一步？别死。"

# game/script.rpy:3728
translate Chinese po02_01_842fa091:

    # be "Then tonight we stay quiet, stay hidden, and don't draw attention."
    be "那今晚我们就保持安静，藏好自己，别引人注意。"

# game/script.rpy:3729
translate Chinese po02_01_732fe9c5:

    # be "If we make it till morning, we'll have a better chance."
    be "要是能撑到天亮，我们的胜算会更大。"

# game/script.rpy:3730
translate Chinese po02_01_1a4c92cb:

    # du "If we move tomorrow, we stay off the main roads."
    du "明天要走的话，咱们得避开主干道。"

# game/script.rpy:3731
translate Chinese po02_01_5aeb9916:

    # du "Highways'll be a kill zone by then."
    du "到时候高速公路肯定是个杀戮场。"

# game/script.rpy:3733
translate Chinese po02_01_1000ba82:

    # aj "Hold up, any of y'all got a ride?"
    aj "等等，你们谁有车吗？"

# game/script.rpy:3734
translate Chinese po02_01_7abcdcbf:

    # aj "Cause walkin' across this whole damn city ain't exactly my idea of a good time."
    aj "因为徒步穿越整座该死的城市，可不是我理想中的乐子。"

# game/script.rpy:3736
translate Chinese po02_01_3e622cba:

    # wi "I did."
    wi "我有过。"

# game/script.rpy:3737
translate Chinese po02_01_be1b5483:

    # wi "Had to leave it on the street when everything went to hell."
    wi "一切乱起来的时候只能把车丢在街上了。"

# game/script.rpy:3738
translate Chinese po02_01_05d4d1aa:

    # wi "And judging by what's happening down there... we're not getting it back."
    wi "看下面的情况……我们是拿不回来了。"

# game/script.rpy:3740
translate Chinese po02_01_b5c4d466:

    # be "Most of the roads are probably blocked anyway."
    be "反正大部分路应该也都堵死了。"

# game/script.rpy:3742
translate Chinese po02_01_0e21ecf1:

    # du "Mine's still in a parking lot. 'Bout two blocks from here."
    du "我的车还停在停车场，离这儿大概两个街区。"

# game/script.rpy:3743
translate Chinese po02_01_52cc3756:

    # du "Old pickup. Ain't pretty, but she runs."
    du "一辆老皮卡，不好看，但能跑。"

# game/script.rpy:3745
translate Chinese po02_01_a1c5b35e:

    # aj "Man, now you talkin'. Two blocks in this chaos might as well be two miles."
    aj "老天，这话我爱听。不过这种乱局里，两个街区跟两英里也没啥区别了。"

# game/script.rpy:3747
translate Chinese po02_01_b5dc02f1:

    # du "Maybe. But it's still our best shot."
    du "也许吧，但这仍然是咱们最好的机会。"

# game/script.rpy:3748
translate Chinese po02_01_95bb2df2:

    # du "So what's the call, soldier?"
    du "那怎么定，当兵的？"

# game/script.rpy:3750
translate Chinese po02_01_aae4007e:

    # wi "If we make it to your truck, we won't have to cross the whole city on foot."
    wi "要是能到你的卡车那儿，我们就不用徒步穿越整座城市了。"

# game/script.rpy:3752
translate Chinese po02_01_ae0e26b2:

    # be "A vehicle changes everything."
    be "有辆车，一切都不一样了。"

# game/script.rpy:3754
translate Chinese po02_01_0200b7a7:

    # wi "Then that's the plan."
    wi "那就这么定了。"

# game/script.rpy:3755
translate Chinese po02_01_0f579ef5:

    # wi "We get to Dust's truck... and we drive for the Empire."
    wi "我们先去达斯特的卡车那儿……然后开车去帝国商场。"

# game/script.rpy:3757
translate Chinese po02_01_d23594a5:

    # du "Then we better get off this roof before those things figure out we're up here."
    du "那咱们最好趁那些东西还没发现我们在楼顶，赶紧下去。"

# game/script.rpy:3759
translate Chinese po02_01_c201bea5:

    # aj "Hold up, what the hell you got on your back?"
    aj "等等，你背上那是啥玩意儿？"

# game/script.rpy:3761
translate Chinese po02_01_2d966d51:

    # yu "Huh?"
    yu "嗯？"

# game/script.rpy:3762
translate Chinese po02_01_1320ae13:

    # aj "That stick right there."
    aj "就那根棍子。"

# game/script.rpy:3764
translate Chinese po02_01_b31119b1:

    # yu "It's..."
    yu "那是……"

# game/script.rpy:3767
translate Chinese po02_01_25256222:

    # yu "A sword."
    yu "一把剑。"

# game/script.rpy:3769
translate Chinese po02_01_80ffdb33:

    # aj "Man... hold up."
    aj "老天……等等。"

# game/script.rpy:3770
translate Chinese po02_01_33cc4018:

    # aj "You had a damn sword this whole time?"
    aj "你这一路上都带着把剑？"

# game/script.rpy:3771
translate Chinese po02_01_63c3de90:

    # aj "Then why the hell you ain't use it back there?"
    aj "那你刚才他妈怎么不用？"

