# game/script.rpy:7541
translate Chinese po02_01_con_3_5a61efa0:

    # jjj "So what we're witnessing now... could this be the same substance?"
    jjj "那么我们现在所目睹的……会是同一种物质吗？"

# game/script.rpy:7542
translate Chinese po02_01_con_3_19c32fca:

    # drste "That's the question everyone is asking."
    drste "这正是每个人都在问的问题。"

# game/script.rpy:7543
translate Chinese po02_01_con_3_fc696f1f:

    # drste "We've faced global health crises before."
    drste "我们以前也面对过全球性的健康危机。"

# game/script.rpy:7544
translate Chinese po02_01_con_3_4b2a2dd6:

    # drste "During COVID, the threat spread silently, often before anyone knew they were infected."
    drste "在新冠疫情期间，威胁悄无声息地扩散，往往在人们意识到自己被感染之前就已经传播开来。"

# game/script.rpy:7545
translate Chinese po02_01_con_3_79d8264a:

    # drste "But this..."
    drste "但这次……"

# game/script.rpy:7546
translate Chinese po02_01_con_3_7927097b:

    # drste "This is different."
    drste "情况不一样。"

# game/script.rpy:7547
translate Chinese po02_01_con_3_675229f7:

    # drste "It's fast. Violent. Unpredictable."
    drste "传播得快，暴烈，而且难以预测。"

# game/script.rpy:7548
translate Chinese po02_01_con_3_fe6e9405:

    # drste "COVID taught us how quickly systems can collapse under pressure."
    drste "新冠疫情教会了我们，系统在压力之下能崩溃得多快。"

# game/script.rpy:7549
translate Chinese po02_01_con_3_96bf6567:

    # drste "If this behaves the way it appears to..."
    drste "如果这次的情况真如表面看起来那样发展……"

# game/script.rpy:7550
translate Chinese po02_01_con_3_f4e73ffc:

    # drste "It could be worse."
    drste "情况可能会更糟。"

# game/script.rpy:7551
translate Chinese po02_01_con_3_63a319bc:

    # drste "And right now... we don't know if this is still a drug..."
    drste "而目前……我们还不知道这究竟仍是一种毒品……"

# game/script.rpy:7552
translate Chinese po02_01_con_3_5e643c94:

    # drste "...or the beginning of something much worse."
    drste "……还是某种更可怕事态的开端。"

