translate Chinese po02_01_con_3_0b995524:

    # moln "I do... That's why I'm still here."
    moln "我知道……所以我才留在这儿。"

# game/script.rpy:8054
translate Chinese po02_01_con_3_e792ead0:

    # wi "So you knew. And you kept her here?"
    wi "所以你早就知道。还把她留在这儿？"

# game/script.rpy:8055
translate Chinese po02_01_con_3_4971f368:

    # wi "A few floors below a drug stash?"
    wi "就住在毒品藏匿点下面几层？"

# game/script.rpy:8057
translate Chinese po02_01_con_3_32f44aec:

    # be "Wait... Will. What are you talking about?"
    be "等等……威尔。你在说什么？"

# game/script.rpy:8059
translate Chinese po02_01_con_3_1bdf5d6d:

    # moln "They won't come down here."
    moln "他们不会下来这儿。"

# game/script.rpy:8060
translate Chinese po02_01_con_3_f0351faa:

    # moln "That girl's been safer here than anywhere else in this building."
    moln "这女孩在这儿，比这栋楼里任何地方都安全。"

# game/script.rpy:8061
translate Chinese po02_01_con_3_9bd4c469:

    # moln "Safer than the streets. Safer than being alone."
    moln "比街上安全。比孤身一人安全。"

# game/script.rpy:8062
translate Chinese po02_01_con_3_d9c8ff59:

    # moln "So don't look at me like I put her in danger. I kept her alive."
    moln "所以别用那种眼神看我，好像是我把她害的。是我让她活了下来。"

# game/script.rpy:8064
translate Chinese po02_01_con_3_5647ccdd:

    # wi "Maybe you did. But that doesn't make it safe."
    wi "也许是这样。但那不代表这儿安全。"

# game/script.rpy:8065
translate Chinese po02_01_con_3_55612f9a:

    # wi "Not with a stash like that sitting above her head."
    wi "头顶上就压着那么个藏匿点，能安全吗？"

# game/script.rpy:8066
translate Chinese po02_01_con_3_031e2719:

    # wi "All it takes is one mistake. One guy high out of his mind."
    wi "只要出一次差错。一个嗑嗨了的家伙。"

# game/script.rpy:8067
translate Chinese po02_01_con_3_022b19af:

    # wi "And everything you built here is gone."
    wi "你在这儿建立起来的一切就全完了。"

# game/script.rpy:8068
translate Chinese po02_01_con_3_24b9157c:

    # wi "I'm not rolling those odds. She's coming with us. That's the call."
    wi "我不赌这个。她跟我们走。就这么定了。"

# game/script.rpy:8070
translate Chinese po02_01_con_3_d0a353e2:

    # moln "Don't start giving me orders."
    moln "别开始对我发号施令。"

# game/script.rpy:8071
translate Chinese po02_01_con_3_d3738ed5:

    # moln "I know exactly what I'm doing."
    moln "我很清楚自己在做什么。"

# game/script.rpy:8072
translate Chinese po02_01_con_3_84a99d50:

    # moln "I've been taking care of her long before you showed up."
    moln "早在你出现之前，我就一直在照顾她了。"

# game/script.rpy:8073
translate Chinese po02_01_con_3_6538348a:

    # moln "Kept her fed. Kept her breathing."
    moln "让她吃饱。让她活着。"

# game/script.rpy:8074
translate Chinese po02_01_con_3_0d08a26f:

    # moln "So don't come in here acting like you know better."
    moln "所以别跑来这儿摆出一副你更懂的样子。"

# game/script.rpy:8075
translate Chinese po02_01_con_3_56934518:

    # moln "And stay out of this."
    moln "这件事，你别插手。"

