    # wi "I should've been more specific. You followed the order. That's on me."
    wi "我应该说得更明确点。你只是照命令行事。这是我的责任。"

# game/script.rpy:12764
translate Chinese po02_01_con_4_qte_1_goodend_81f05209:

    # wi "Next time... If you see weapons that can improve our chances..."
    wi "下次……如果你看到能提高我们胜算的武器……"

