# game/script.rpy:17192
translate Chinese po02_02_fd97e963:

    # ren "You left everything I had out there. My bike, my gear, my shotgun, my friends, everything!"
    ren "你们把我所有的东西都留在外面了。我的摩托车、我的装备、我的霰弹枪、我的朋友们，全都没了！"

# game/script.rpy:17193
