    # extsashan "Virgie, we've secured all the entrances to this room. We should be safe for now."
    extsashan "弗吉，我们已经把这房间所有的入口都封好了。暂时应该是安全的。"

# game/script.rpy:17202
translate Chinese po02_02_54165a46:

    # virn "Your arm... We need to take care of that first."
    virn "你的手臂……我们得先处理一下。"

