    # virn "That's alright. It's scary out there, but you did great."
    virn "没关系。外面确实很吓人，但你表现得很棒。"

# game/script.rpy:17236
translate Chinese po02_02_c31b7392:

    # virn "You were so quick to find that door. You helped save everyone."
    virn "你那么快就找到了那扇门。你帮忙救了大家。"

# game/script.rpy:17238
translate Chinese po02_02_abee41a1:

    # ev "Really? I just thought it looked like a good hiding spot..."
    ev "真的吗？我只是觉得那儿看起来像个不错的藏身处……"

# game/script.rpy:17240
translate Chinese po02_02_193460c4:

    # virn "Exactly, that's what makes you so smart. Quick thinking like that is what keeps people safe."
    virn "没错，这就是你聪明的地方。这种快速反应正是能保命的关键。"

# game/script.rpy:17242
translate Chinese po02_02_4d349ae6:

    # ev "Thanks."
    ev "谢谢。"

# game/script.rpy:17244
translate Chinese po02_02_2f5e185e:

    # wi "I'm just checking on my sister. Thanks for comforting her."
    wi "我就是过来看看我妹妹。谢谢你安慰她。"

# game/script.rpy:17246
translate Chinese po02_02_af3ba184:

    # virn "She's adorable. A brave little one, and quick on her feet, too."
    virn "她很可爱。一个勇敢的小家伙，反应也很快。"

# game/script.rpy:17247
translate Chinese po02_02_dbe79fac:

    # virn "Let me guess—you're military, aren't you?"
    virn "让我猜猜——你是军人吧？"

# game/script.rpy:17249
translate Chinese po02_02_7141d708:

    # wi "Used to be. I've been discharged for about a year now."
    wi "曾经是。我退伍差不多一年了。"

# game/script.rpy:17251
translate Chinese po02_02_726902d4:

    # virn "Figured as much. Though you don't exactly have the 'look.'"
    virn "我猜也是。不过你倒不太像那种「样子」。"

# game/script.rpy:17253
translate Chinese po02_02_bc8b5818:

    # ev "Yeah, well, even a bomb couldn't stop my brother."
    ev "是啊，反正炸弹都拦不住我哥。"

