    virn "好了，我去看看我搭档的伤口怎么样了。然后我会用无线电联系局里求助。"

# game/script.rpy:17259
translate Chinese po02_02_237b40b2:

    # wi "You think they'll respond? With everything going on out there?"
    wi "你觉得他们会回应吗？外面都乱成这样了。"

# game/script.rpy:17261
translate Chinese po02_02_5428f688:

    # virn "If anyone's still listening, they will. This isn't my first rodeo."
    virn "只要还有人在听，他们就会回应的。这种事我又不是第一次经历。"

