    # be "If it hurts, I'm sorry. I'll try to be gentle."
    be "要是弄疼你了，抱歉。我会尽量轻一点。"

# game/script.rpy:17316
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_2a8fed40:

    # extsashan "Don't worry about it. Being a cop in Los Suenos, we're practically addicted to violence."
    extsashan "别担心。在洛斯苏埃诺斯当警察，我们几乎是把暴力当饭吃的。"

# game/script.rpy:17317
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_8003ff64:

    # extsashan "Getting shot at is just a part of the job. A scratch like this? Barely even worth mentioning."
    extsashan "挨枪子儿就是工作的一部分。这点小抓伤？根本不值一提。"

# game/script.rpy:17319
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_f0a8e8dc:

    # be "Yeah, I get it."
    be "嗯，我理解。"

# game/script.rpy:17321
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_3e59619c:

    # be "Back when I worked at the hospital, I was pulling bullets out of cops almost daily."
    be "我在医院工作的时候，几乎每天都要从警察身上取出子弹。"

# game/script.rpy:17322
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_d642df0e:

    # be "You know, I once removed a bullet from a cop who'd been shot by a thief, and not long after, I removed a bullet from the same thief, shot by that same cop. It's insane."
    be "你知道吗，我曾经从一个被小偷开枪打中的警察身上取出过子弹。结果没过多久，我又从那个小偷身上取出了一颗子弹，还是同一个警察打的。简直离谱。"

# game/script.rpy:17323
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_1eb52c0e:

    # extsashan "This is Los Suenos. The city of dreams."
    extsashan "这就是洛斯苏埃诺斯。梦想之城。"

# game/script.rpy:17325
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_64102406:

    # be "Sometimes I wondered if I was really helping or just patching people up so they could hurt each other again. It gets exhausting, you know?"
    be "有时候我会怀疑，我到底是在真正帮助别人，还是只是把人缝合好，好让他们继续互相伤害。挺让人身心俱疲的，你懂吗？"

# game/script.rpy:17327
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_1fbfb48b:

    # extsashan "Sounds familiar. I arrest someone one day, and the next, they're back on the streets like nothing happened."
    extsashan "听起来很熟悉。我今天抓了个人，第二天他又若无其事地回到街上了。"

# game/script.rpy:17328
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_99288bf1:

    # extsashan "Sometimes it feels like we're just running in circles."
    extsashan "有时候感觉我们就是在原地打转。"

# game/script.rpy:17330
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_b9ca3caa:

    # be "Exactly. You wouldn't believe how many people come in thinking they're invincible. So, what's your craziest story from the field?"
    be "没错。你不会相信有多少人自认为刀枪不入，跑到医院来。那你出勤时遇到过最离谱的事是什么？"

# game/script.rpy:17332
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_3d75a680:

    # extsashan "Craziest? Probably the time a guy tried to rob a store wearing a clown mask and got himself locked in the storage room."
    extsashan "最离谱的？大概是有次一个家伙戴着小丑面具去抢劫商店，结果把自己锁进了储藏室。"

# game/script.rpy:17333
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_13825d98:

    # extsashan "We had to drag him out, and he kept yelling, 'It's not my fault! The mask made me do it!'"
    extsashan "我们不得不把他拖出来，他还一直喊，「不是我的错！是这面具让我这么做的！」"

# game/script.rpy:17335
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_74f01e63:

    # be "You're kidding me! That's straight out of a video game."
    be "不是吧！这简直跟电子游戏里演的一样。"

# game/script.rpy:17337
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_3f778fe6:

    # extsashan "I wish I was. That's Los Suenos for you."
    extsashan "我倒希望自己是在开玩笑。这就是洛斯苏埃诺斯。"

# game/script.rpy:17338
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_6aad4980:

    # extsashan "Guess there's no escape from chaos, huh? At least this time, I've got a nurse patching me up instead of some rookie EMT who looks ready to faint."
    extsashan "看来是逃不掉这份混乱了，是吧？至少这次给我包扎的是个护士，而不是那个看着随时要晕过去的菜鸟急救员。"

# game/script.rpy:17340
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_2a8a1bdb:

    # be "Hey, don't knock the rookies. We all started somewhere."
    be "嘿，别瞧不起菜鸟。我们都是这么过来的。"

# game/script.rpy:17341
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_3026c770:

    # be "Besides, you're lucky I'm here, or you'd be stuck with that biker trying to bandage you up. Can you imagine that?"
    be "再说了，算你走运有我在，不然就得让那个骑摩托的姑娘给你包扎了。你能想象那画面吗？"

# game/script.rpy:17343
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_fc2d57a1:

    # extsashan "God, I think I'd rather take my chances with the infection. She'll kill me for sure."
    extsashan "天哪，我宁愿冒险被感染。她肯定会弄死我的。"

