    wi "没人回应吗？"

# game/script.rpy:17429
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_5ef12e33:

    # virn "Yeah, no one's answering. I called everyone, every unit... completely silent."
    virn "是啊，没人接。我联系了所有人，每个分队……一片死寂。"

# game/script.rpy:17430
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_b91d48c7:

    # virn "It's like the whole city's empty."
    virn "感觉整座城市都空了。"

# game/script.rpy:17431
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_d7d0b7c9:

    # virn "But I'll try contacting others in a different way. I know someone who might be able to get us out of here."
    virn "但我会试试别的联系方式。我认识一个人也许能帮我们离开这儿。"

# game/script.rpy:17435
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_f2e6c407:

    # wi "No one's going to answer... it's just us now. We'll have to find another way."
    wi "没人会回应了……现在只剩我们自己了。我们得另想办法。"

# game/script.rpy:17437
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_eeaa4ae0:

    # vir "Maybe you're right, but I'll try again. I still know someone who might help... we can't give up."
    vir "也许你是对的，但我会再试一次。我还认识一个也许能帮忙的人……我们不能放弃。"

# game/script.rpy:17440
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_00f903f8:

    # be "All done. She's patched up."
    be "好了。处理好了。"

# game/script.rpy:17442
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_8672e86b:

    # extsashan "Did you manage to reach anyone?"
    extsashan "你联系上谁了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:17444
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_0c513225:

    # virn "No luck yet. The frequencies are a mess."
    virn "还没有。频道都乱成一团了。"

# game/script.rpy:17445
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_1677fb39:

    # virn "But I'll try reaching out to an old friend of mine. She works with the Air Force, she's a Blackhawk pilot."
    virn "但我会试着联系一个老朋友。她在空军工作，是个黑鹰直升机飞行员。"

# game/script.rpy:17447
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_a82ebe1b:

    # be "The military? Are you sure your friend's gonna have time to answer a call right now?"
    be "军方？你确定你朋友现在有空接电话吗？"

# game/script.rpy:17449
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_429af1b3:

    # virn "If anyone's still airborne in this mess, it's her. She's one hell of a pilot, and she owes me a favor."
    virn "要是这团乱局里还有人在天上飞的话，那肯定是她。她可是个厉害的飞行员，而且她还欠我一个人情。"

# game/script.rpy:17451
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_afc96636:

    # wi "A Blackhawk pilot owing you a favor? Sounds like there's a story there."
    wi "一个黑鹰飞行员欠你人情？听起来这里面有故事。"

# game/script.rpy:17453
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_959feeab:

    # virn "Let's just say I helped her out of a tough spot once. She's not the type to forget."
    virn "就这么说吧，我曾经帮她渡过一个难关。她不是那种会忘恩负义的人。"

# game/script.rpy:17455
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_1d4a0e3b:

    # ev "So, if she picks up, does that mean we're getting a helicopter ride out of here?"
    ev "那如果她接了电话，是不是就意味着我们能坐直升机离开这儿了？"

# game/script.rpy:17457
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_a90aac5b:

    # virn "If she's in the air and can get to us, maybe. But don't get your hopes up too high just yet, okay?"
    virn "要是她正在飞行而且能过来接我们，也许可以。但先别抱太大希望，好吗？"

# game/script.rpy:17459
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_e2b6c958:

    # extsashan "Alright, let's see what your friend can do. But we better have a backup plan. Those things out there aren't gonna wait around forever."
    extsashan "好吧，看看你朋友能做什么。但我们最好还是有个备用方案。外面那些东西可不会一直等着。"

# game/script.rpy:17461
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_83d8f682:

    # extsashan "Alright, since we're all stuck here together, we should at least know who we're dealing with."
    extsashan "好了，既然我们都被困在这儿了，至少应该互相认识一下。"

# game/script.rpy:17462
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_47209363:

    # extsasha "I'm Sasha, and this is my partner, Virginia."
    extsasha "我是萨莎，这是我的搭档，弗吉尼亚。"

# game/script.rpy:17464
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_27d0acf3:

    # wi "I'm Will, and this is my sister, Evelyn."
    wi "我是威尔，这是我妹妹，伊芙琳。"

# game/script.rpy:17466
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_93eb8142:

    # be "And I'm Beth. Nice to meet you all."
    be "我是贝丝。很高兴认识大家。"

# game/script.rpy:17468
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_af22be9f:

    # vir "Nice to meet you, little one. Evelyn, right? You're a brave."
    vir "很高兴认识你，小家伙。伊芙琳，对吧？你很勇敢。"

# game/script.rpy:17470
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_e255c593:

    # ev "Thank you..."
    ev "谢谢……"

# game/script.rpy:17472
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_92a5f1fa:

    # extsasha "And you? What's your name?"
    extsasha "那你呢？你叫什么名字？"

# game/script.rpy:17474
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_98d80403:

    # ren "Rhea..."
    ren "瑞亚……"

# game/script.rpy:17476
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_cd30ac3d:

    # ren "But honestly, if you're planning to keep me cuffed like this, what's the point? What's next, huh? Dump me in a holding cell at your station?"
    ren "但说实话，你们要是打算就这么一直铐着我，图什么呢？接下来怎么办，啊？把我扔进你们局里的拘留室？"

# game/script.rpy:17477
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_c7913325:

    # ren "With the whole city crawling with vampires? Yeah, great plan."
    ren "整座城市到处都是那些感染者在爬？好啊，真是好计划。"

# game/script.rpy:17479
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_17f93e77:

    # vir "You're a criminal. How much trust do you think you've earned from us? Especially after the stunts you've pulled?"
    vir "你是个罪犯。你觉得你能从我们这儿得到多少信任？尤其是你之前干的那些事？"

# game/script.rpy:17481
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_36186def:

    # ren "Pulled? You mean surviving? Funny, you don't seem to mind having me around when it suits you."
    ren "干的事？你是说活下来这件事？有意思，需要我的时候你倒不介意我在旁边。"

# game/script.rpy:17483
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_a001163a:

    # ren "Ah... Whatever."
    ren "啊……随便吧。"

