    # be "Hey, Will. When was the last time we actually sat down and ate together like this?"
    be "嘿，威尔。我们上一次这样坐在一起吃饭是什么时候？"

# game/script.rpy:17537
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_d2de079e:

    # wi "Probably prom night. You know, the night we said goodbye and didn't think we'd see each other again."
    wi "大概是毕业舞会那晚吧。就是我们道别的那晚，当时都以为不会再见面了。"

# game/script.rpy:17539
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_57b80778:

    # extsasha "Wait, you two danced together at prom? Seriously?"
    extsasha "等等，你们俩毕业舞会上一起跳过舞？真的假的？"

# game/script.rpy:17541
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_c00b9bb0:

    # be "Yeah, we did. We were the only two losers without a date, so we paired up. 'A loser duo'."
    be "是啊，跳过。我们俩是仅有的两个没有舞伴的可怜虫，所以就凑成了一对。「废柴二人组」。"

# game/script.rpy:17543
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_e9bb0def:

    # wi "You're making it sound worse than it was. We actually had fun."
    wi "你说得比实际情况糟多了。我们其实玩得挺开心的。"

# game/script.rpy:17545
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_5fd5aad7:

    # be "Yeah, but you kept stepping on my toes. I'm surprised I made it out of that night without a broken foot."
    be "是啊，但你一直踩我的脚。我很惊讶那晚我居然没摔断脚。"

# game/script.rpy:17547
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_f2da609e:

    # wi "Hey, I wasn't that bad. At least you didn't ditch me halfway through."
    wi "嘿，我没那么差吧。至少你没中途甩下我。"

# game/script.rpy:17549
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_4b834a3b:

    # extsasha "Stepping on her toes? Classic."
    extsasha "踩她的脚？真是经典。"

# game/script.rpy:17550
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_4a8fe142:

    # extsasha "So, were you two, like... a thing? Boyfriend and girlfriend?"
    extsasha "那你们俩是不是……在一起过？男女朋友那种？"

# game/script.rpy:17552
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_0ae9bcd0_33:

    # ""
    ""

# game/script.rpy:17554
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_874e1199:

    # be "God, no! We just ran into each other again by chance today, after all those years."
    be "天哪，没有！我们就是今天又碰巧遇上了，隔了这么多年。"

# game/script.rpy:17556
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_9e36e91c:

    # extsasha "So, what you're saying is... this guy's single, huh?"
    extsasha "那也就是说……这家伙是单身咯？"

# game/script.rpy:17558
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_62274a1b:

    # ev "My brother? Oh, he's very single. Can't flirt to save his life!"
    ev "我哥？哦，他单身得很。撩妹的本事简直是零！"

# game/script.rpy:17560
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_3bde2e5c:

    # wi "Thanks, Evelyn. Just throw me under the bus, why don't you?"
    wi "谢了，伊芙琳。你怎么不干脆直接把我卖了呢？"

# game/script.rpy:17562
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_ac84fed1:

    # be "She's not wrong, though. You were pretty bad at flirting back in high school."
    be "不过她说得也没错。你高中的时候撩人的本事就挺烂的。"

# game/script.rpy:17564
translate Chinese po02_02_con_1_99ad44ec:

    # extsasha "Guess some things never change, huh?"
    extsasha "看来有些事是永远不会变的，是吧？"

