# game/script.rpy:17656
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_3e3baf40:

    # be "Will, it looks like the phone signal is back."
    be "威尔，看起来手机信号恢复了。"

# game/script.rpy:17657
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_08716cc8:

    # be "I checked social media, and my feed is flooded with news about this."
    be "我看了社交媒体，我的动态全都被这件事的新闻刷屏了。"

# game/script.rpy:17659
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_c12755db:

    # wi "That's something, at least. Have you tried calling anyone yet?"
    wi "至少这算是个好消息。你试过打电话给谁了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:17661
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_7313bfa6:

    # be "I tried calling my mom, but..."
    be "我试着给我妈打了电话，但是……"

# game/script.rpy:17663
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_d67c6d4a:

    # be "She didn't pick up."
    be "她没接。"

# game/script.rpy:17665
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_92a350df:

    # wi "I'm sorry, Beth. I really hope she's safe."
    wi "抱歉，贝丝。我真心希望她平安无事。"

# game/script.rpy:17667
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_874191d6:

    # be "Yeah... I hope so too."
    be "是啊……我也希望如此。"

# game/script.rpy:17669
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_1c9c7e2e:

    # vir "Hey... I got through to the police group at The Empire Mall."
    vir "嘿……我联系上帝国商场那边的警察小组了。"

# game/script.rpy:17670
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_6de5a62c:

    # vir "They're really there, just like the Chief said. They've set up an evacuation center and are flying civilians out of the city using police helicopters."
    vir "他们真的在那儿，就跟局长说的一样。他们设立了一个疏散中心，正在用警用直升机把平民空运出城。"

# game/script.rpy:17672
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_c87a9cbe:

    # wi "That's great news. Did you ask for help?"
    wi "这真是好消息。你请求支援了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:17674
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_4d4c9ab8:

    # vir "I did, but... they can't send anyone. They're stretched too thin."
    vir "我问了，但是……他们派不出人手。他们的人手已经捉襟见肘了。"

# game/script.rpy:17675
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_33be2019:

    # vir "If we want to get there, we'll have to make the trip ourselves."
    vir "如果我们想去那儿，就得自己想办法过去。"

# game/script.rpy:17677
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_0ae9bcd0_1:

    # ""
    ""

# game/script.rpy:17679
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_0f4bef34:

    # be "Hey, Virginia, you said you have a friend in the Air Force, right? I have something similar."
    be "嘿，弗吉尼亚，你说你有个朋友在空军，对吧？我也认识一个这样的人。"

# game/script.rpy:17681
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_93d5ef69:

    # vir "Yeah, you do?"
    vir "是吗，真的？"

# game/script.rpy:17683
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_4611ad9c:

    # be "If we need a way out, maybe she could help. Let me try calling her now."
    be "如果我们需要一条出路，也许她能帮上忙。我现在就试试给她打电话。"

# game/script.rpy:17689
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_a61f3abd:

    # femv "Beth? Is that you? Are you okay?"
    femv "贝丝？是你吗？你还好吗？"

# game/script.rpy:17690
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_8d01df71:

    # be "Yeah, it's me, Lynette. Where are you right now?"
    be "对，是我，琳妮特。你现在在哪儿？"

# game/script.rpy:17692
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_94ccd285:

    # extlyn "I'm on the East Coast. Just got back from Almenistan."
    extlyn "我在东海岸。刚从阿尔梅尼斯坦回来。"

# game/script.rpy:17693
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_67371c74:

    # extlyn " I'll be flying a Black Hawk soon. What about you? Where are you?"
    extlyn "我很快就要驾驶黑鹰直升机执行任务了。你呢？你在哪儿？"

# game/script.rpy:17695
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_e137f979:

    # be "I'm in Los Suenos. Things are bad here."
    be "我在洛斯苏埃诺斯。这儿的情况很糟糕。"

# game/script.rpy:17697
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_82f966d5:

    # vir "Wait... is that Lynette Wyatt?"
    vir "等等……那是琳妮特·怀亚特吗？"

# game/script.rpy:17698
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_4503e3bf:

    # extlyn "Yeah, I thought I recognized that voice."
    extlyn "是啊，我就觉得这声音耳熟。"

# game/script.rpy:17699
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_17959bbf:

    # vir "It's me, Virginia Lewis."
    vir "是我，弗吉尼亚·刘易斯。"

# game/script.rpy:17700
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_3044f59f:

    # extlyn "Oh, Lewis! I'd never forget you. Small world, huh?"
    extlyn "哦，刘易斯！我不会忘了你的。这世界可真小，是吧？"

# game/script.rpy:17702
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_f0a45f96:

    # be "Wait... you two know each other?"
    be "等等……你们俩认识？"

# game/script.rpy:17703
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_f1ee2464:

    # extlyn "Yeah, Lewis saved my ass once, Black Hawk Down on the outskirts of Talil. Crazy how the world works."
    extlyn "是啊，刘易斯救过我一命——就是塔利勒郊外那回，《黑鹰坠落》。这世界真够绕的。"

# game/script.rpy:17704
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_2fc80725:

    # extlyn "So, what's it like over there?"
    extlyn "那你们那边情况怎么样？"

# game/script.rpy:17706
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_1dc6a248:

    # vir "Not great. The whole city looks like it's been through a war. What about on your end?"
    vir "不太好。整座城市看起来就像经历了一场战争。你那边呢？"

# game/script.rpy:17707
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_8328c68a:

    # extlyn "Quiet for now. After the outbreak hit the news, there was chaos everywhere, but the curfew was in place, and the military cleared the streets."
    extlyn "目前还算平静。疫情消息播出后，到处都乱了套，但宵禁已经实施，军方把街道都清理了。"

# game/script.rpy:17708
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_8931f590:

    # extlyn "No signs of zombies here, at least not yet."
    extlyn "这儿还没有丧尸的迹象，至少现在还没有。"

# game/script.rpy:17709
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_9120efa9:

    # be "So the East Coast is safe?"
    be "那东海岸是安全的？"

# game/script.rpy:17710
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_23fb7a65:

    # extlyn "For now, yeah. But who knows how long that'll last."
    extlyn "目前是的。但谁知道能撑多久。"

# game/script.rpy:17711
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_86a3c8a5:

    # be "Do you think there's any chance you could fly over and get us out?"
    be "你有可能飞过来接我们出去吗？"

# game/script.rpy:17712
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_4825b3ee:

    # extlyn "Beth, I really wish I could, but I can't without orders."
    extlyn "贝丝，我真的很想，但没有命令我不能行动。"

# game/script.rpy:17713
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_be76813a:

    # extlyn "I can't fly across the country just like that. I'm sorry. I've got to go now, but I'll check in when I can. Stay safe, both of you."
    extlyn "我不能就这么飞越整个国家。对不起。我得挂了，但我一有空就会联系你们的。你们俩都要注意安全。"

# game/script.rpy:17716
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_7fb239b7:

    # be "I hope she's right about the East Coast."
    be "希望她说的东海岸情况是真的。"

# game/script.rpy:17718
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_478f2e87:

    # vir "She'll come through if she can. For now, let's focus on getting out of here."
    vir "如果她能做到，她会来的。现在，我们先专心离开这儿吧。"

# game/script.rpy:17720
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_d5892b24:

    # be "Yeah, you're right."
    be "嗯，你说得对。"

# game/script.rpy:17722
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_c384e908:

    # be "So, what's the plan? What are we doing tomorrow?"
    be "那接下来怎么办？我们明天要做什么？"

# game/script.rpy:17723
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_bc7e451e:

    # be "We could stay in this room for months if we wanted."
    be "我们要是想的话，可以在这房间里待上好几个月。"

# game/script.rpy:17725
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_1d5b6bd7:

    # ren "I'm not in."
    ren "我不参与。"

# game/script.rpy:17728
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_604cc16d:

    # vir "I thought you were asleep."
    vir "我以为你睡着了。"

# game/script.rpy:17730
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_1147e35b:

    # ren "Who could sleep in here, huh? I've been trying to play nice, just like you said."
    ren "谁能在这儿睡得着？我一直在收着性子呢，就跟你说的那样。"

# game/script.rpy:17732
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_7e893f02:

    # ren "No shouting, no trouble. Figured you'd let me go."
    ren "不喊不闹。还以为你会放我走呢。"

# game/script.rpy:17733
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_9136ab58:

    # ren "But staying holed up in this room? That's a terrible idea."
    ren "但一直窝在这房间里？这主意糟透了。"

# game/script.rpy:17735
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_cfb36498:

    # vir "I kind of agree. Staying locked up in here doesn't sound like a good idea."
    vir "我倒有点同意。一直锁在这儿听起来确实不是个好主意。"

# game/script.rpy:17737
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_80918fb5:

    # be "I understand, I just thought I’d suggest another option."
    be "我理解，我只是想提个别的办法。"

# game/script.rpy:17739
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_146133b6:

    # wi "From what we know, there's an evacuation center at The Empire Mall not far from here. They're helping people get out of the city."
    wi "据我们所知，离这儿不远的帝国商场有个疏散中心。他们在帮助人们撤离这座城市。"

# game/script.rpy:17741
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_b6dd2e40:

    # be "Maybe we should take a long trip east. Lynette said there aren't any zombies there yet. What do you think?"
    be "也许我们该往东走很长一段路。琳妮特说那边还没有丧尸。你觉得呢？"

# game/script.rpy:17743
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_1e70310a:

    # ren "My biker gang was based in New Yankton."
    ren "我的摩托帮以前的据点在新扬克顿。"

# game/script.rpy:17745
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_bb938ad8:

    # ren "We made a mess there and had to ride cross-country just to get away a few years ago."
    ren "几年前我们在那儿捅了个大篓子，不得不横跨全国骑车才逃出来。"

# game/script.rpy:17746
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_fad25bfd:

    # ren "There's no way I'm riding all the way back across the country again. That was painful as hell."
    ren "我绝不会再骑车横穿一次这个国家了。那次可把我折腾惨了。"

# game/script.rpy:17748
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_71c5abdf:

    # be "Then The Empire Mall sounds like our best option."
    be "那帝国商场听起来是我们最好的选择了。"

# game/script.rpy:17750
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_5c0274a7:

    # vir "I agree. What about you? Got any better ideas?"
    vir "我同意。你呢？有更好的主意吗？"

# game/script.rpy:17752
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_f0ccb69b:

    # ren "I'm not leaving my bike behind, but... fine. Not like I have any better options."
    ren "我是不会丢下我的摩托车的，但……好吧。反正我也没有更好的选择。"

# game/script.rpy:17754
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_712a57cd:

    # wi "Looks like we've got our plan for tomorrow."
    wi "看来明天的计划都定好了。"

# game/script.rpy:17755
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_dd63ce0d:

    # vir "Alright, let's wrap it up. And you, get some rest. You're taking over my watch in the morning."
    vir "好了，今天就到这吧。你好好休息，明天早上换你接我的岗。"

# game/script.rpy:17756
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_3e2df76f:

    # wi "Got it. I'll get some sleep and be ready for tomorrow."
    wi "明白。我会好好睡一觉，准备好迎接明天。"

# game/script.rpy:17759
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_0ae9bcd0_2:

    # ""
    ""

# game/script.rpy:17763
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_3db6ea54:

    # NewsAn "We interrupt your regular programming with an emergency update regarding the situation in Los Suenos."
    NewsAn "我们打断常规节目，为您带来洛斯苏埃诺斯局势的紧急更新。"

# game/script.rpy:17765
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_dbf34256:

    # NewsAn "Officials have confirmed, this is no longer just civil unrest. We are now dealing with what can only be described as a zombie outbreak."
    NewsAn "官方已经证实，这已经不仅仅是民众骚乱了。我们现在面对的，只能用「丧尸疫情爆发」来形容。"

# game/script.rpy:17767
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_42cd73bf:

    # NewsAn "In response, both the U.S. Army and the National Guard have been deployed to evacuate civilians from the affected zones."
    NewsAn "对此，美国陆军与国民警卫队已经出动，协助疫区平民撤离。"

# game/script.rpy:17769
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_8698bd13:

    # NewsAn "Military convoys have been seen moving into the city's southern districts since afternoon."
    NewsAn "自下午起，已有军用车队进入该市南部地区。"

# game/script.rpy:17771
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_04ecb734:

    # NewsAn "A state of emergency has been officially declared. All access routes to and from Los Suenos have been sealed off."
    NewsAn "当局已正式宣布进入紧急状态。通往洛斯苏埃诺斯的所有道路均已被封锁。"

# game/script.rpy:17773
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_5adb8dc2:

    # NewsAn "We now go live to an official statement from Colonel Colin, commanding officer of the quarantine operation."
    NewsAn "现在为您播报隔离行动指挥官科林上校的官方声明。"

# game/script.rpy:17775
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_af433eda:

    # extcolin "We've managed to get a lot of people out, families, kids, even some injured. But to be honest?"
    extcolin "我们已经成功撤离了不少人，有家庭、孩子，还有一些伤员。但说实话？"

# game/script.rpy:17776
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_33bf0972:

    # extcolin "The infection's spreading faster than we can keep up. We don't have the time or the people to screen everyone."
    extcolin "感染扩散的速度已经超出我们能控制的范围。我们没有时间，也没有足够的人手去逐一排查。"

# game/script.rpy:17777
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_f126c6ea:

    # extcolin "So yeah, we had to shut the city down. All roads, tunnels, bridges, completely sealed. Not a choice we wanted, but we had no other option."
    extcolin "所以，我们不得不封锁整座城市。所有道路、隧道、桥梁，全部封死。这不是我们想要的选择，但我们别无他法。"

# game/script.rpy:17779
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_4ed3f2d5:

    # extcolin "The real issue now is the panic. People are trying to flee the city from every direction and they're armed to the teeth."
    extcolin "现在真正的问题是恐慌。人们正试图从四面八方逃出这座城市，而且他们全副武装。"

# game/script.rpy:17780
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_a48d0015:

    # extcolin "We're seeing gunfights at evacuation points, roadblocks being torn down... some areas are just flat-out out of control."
    extcolin "撤离点已经出现交火，路障也被拆毁……有些地区已经彻底失控。"

# game/script.rpy:17782
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_5109aa8f:

    # extcolin "And when large groups gather like that? It draws the infected. We've seen it, crowds turn into chaos when the dead show up."
    extcolin "而当人群这样聚集的时候？就会吸引感染者。我们已经见过了，感染者一出现，人群就会陷入混乱。"

# game/script.rpy:17783
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_1645488b:

    # extcolin "We've already lost more troops than I'd like to admit. We're holding the line where we can, but... it's getting harder by the hour."
    extcolin "我们已经损失的士兵，比我愿意承认的要多。能守住的地方我们都在守，但……情况正一小时比一小时艰难。"

# game/script.rpy:17785
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_4643e2b9:

    # NewsAn "Reserve forces are now being recalled into active duty."
    NewsAn "预备役部队目前正被召回，重返现役。"

# game/script.rpy:17787
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_8a998903:

    # NewsAn "The National Guard, along with units from the U.S. Marine Corps have formed a perimeter around the city, attempting to contain what officials are calling a Level 5 Biohazard Event."
    NewsAn "国民警卫队与美国海军陆战队部队已在城市周围组成包围圈，试图控制官方所称的「五级生物危害事件」。"

# game/script.rpy:17789
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_59819536:

    # NewsAn "Communication infrastructure in Los Suenos has completely collapsed. Internet access, mobile signals, and even landlines have ceased operation."
    NewsAn "洛斯苏埃诺斯的通讯设施已彻底瘫痪。网络、手机信号，甚至座机电话都已中断。"

# game/script.rpy:17791
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_5785e947:

    # NewsAn "Only a few civilian videos, captured in the early hours of the outbreak, have surfaced online."
    NewsAn "目前网络上只流出了少数几段视频，都是疫情爆发初期由平民拍摄的。"

# game/script.rpy:17793
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_3805d459:

    # NewsAn "Reports are now confirming new outbreaks across the West Coast, with Texas also showing early signs of infection."
    NewsAn "有报道证实，西海岸多地已出现新的疫情爆发，德克萨斯州也出现了早期感染迹象。"

# game/script.rpy:17795
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_96f488ac:

    # NewsAn "Meanwhile, cities in the Eastern U.S. have erupted into riots in fear of an outbreak spreading nationwide."
    NewsAn "与此同时，美国东部各城市因担忧疫情蔓延全国，已爆发骚乱。"

# game/script.rpy:17796
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_42d604c1:

    # NewsAn "Military forces have been dispatched to maintain order, and several eastern states have followed suit in declaring emergency lockdowns."
    NewsAn "军方已出动维持秩序，东部多个州也相继宣布进入紧急封锁状态。"

# game/script.rpy:17798
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_6a857db6:

    # NewsAn "In New Yankton, the streets are eerily quiet. Supermarkets have run out of stock. All businesses have shut down."
    NewsAn "在新扬克顿，街道诡异地寂静无声。超市货架已经清空，所有商店都已关门。"

# game/script.rpy:17799
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_71484db9:

    # NewsAn "Residents are being urged to remain indoors and conserve resources."
    NewsAn "当局呼吁居民留在室内，并节约使用物资。"

# game/script.rpy:17801
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_cc7491f5:

    # NewsAn "Health experts believe the outbreak may be connected to an illegal synthetic drug identified as {i}Synthozomethyl{/i}..."
    NewsAn "卫生专家认为，此次疫情爆发可能与一种被鉴定为「{i}合成唑甲基{/i}」的非法合成毒品有关……"

