    # wi "Morning, princess. Sleep well?"
    wi "早啊，小公主。睡得好吗？"

# game/script.rpy:17875
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_650e9a4b:

    # ev "My back hurts, my neck hurts... I don't think I slept well at all."
    ev "我背疼，脖子也疼……我觉得我根本没睡好。"

# game/script.rpy:17877
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_4c5468da:

    # wi "Not comfortable, huh? Funny, since you were the first to fall asleep and the last to wake up."
    wi "不舒服是吧？有意思，你可是第一个睡着，最后一个醒的。"

# game/script.rpy:17878
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_ed43e03d:

    # wi "Plus, you were rolling all over the place."
    wi "而且你还翻来滚去的。"

