translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_481a89f8:

    # vir "You cleaned Sasha's wound yesterday, right?"
    vir "你昨天给萨莎清理伤口了，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:17969
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_d3620307:

    # be "Yeah, I cleaned it and made sure the bandages were disinfected too."
    be "对，我清理过了，绷带也都消毒了。"

# game/script.rpy:17971
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_a2d81b52:

    # vir "Last night, I got in touch with the chief over the radio. He sounded... bad."
    vir "昨晚我用无线电联系上了局长。他听起来……状态很不好。"

# game/script.rpy:17972
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_a4febe42:

    # vir "He had a fever, was coughing, and kept rambling nonsense."
    vir "他发着烧，一直咳嗽，还在说些胡话。"

# game/script.rpy:17975
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_0ae9bcd0_28:

    # ""
    ""

# game/script.rpy:17977
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_f5b3d88e:

    # vir "What the... what are you doing?"
    vir "搞什么……你在干什么？"

# game/script.rpy:17979
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_9b380c73:

    # be "You touched someone with a fever, didn't you?"
    be "你碰过发烧的人，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:17980
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_443ef027:

    # be "You said the Chief was sick before he lost control."
    be "你说局长在失控之前就已经生病了。"

# game/script.rpy:17981
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_3b311033:

    # be "That lines up with the crazed patients I've seen recently, they weren't showing symptoms until right before they snapped."
    be "这跟我最近见过的那些发狂病人的情况吻合，他们在彻底失控前几乎没有任何症状。"

# game/script.rpy:17982
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_e1d70b8d:

    # be "They were aggressive like zombies, but not sick at first. Many were on drugs... but we still don't know if this illness is tied to the zombie infection."
    be "他们跟丧尸一样有攻击性，但一开始并没有生病的迹象。很多人还在吸毒……但我们还是不清楚这种病跟丧尸感染是否有关联。"

# game/script.rpy:17983
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_8c1798bd:

    # be "Maybe it's like the movies and only spreads through bites, or maybe not. Until we know more, we treat this like it's COVID-19."
    be "也许就像电影里那样，只通过咬伤传播，也可能不是。在弄清楚之前，我们就当它是COVID-19那样对待。"

# game/script.rpy:17984
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_00b22e58:

    # be "I'll find masks for everyone. We need to start protecting ourselves."
    be "我去给大家找口罩。我们得开始做好防护了。"

# game/script.rpy:17985
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_fc442430:

    # vir "You're serious, huh? I mean, yesterday I touched someone infected too. It's been a whole night. Do you think I'm... infected?"
    vir "你是认真的啊？我是说，昨天我也碰过感染者。都过了一整晚了。你觉得我……被感染了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:17986
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_8fb80708:

    # be "I don't know. And that's exactly why we have to be extra careful. From now on, I'm keeping alcohol spray on me at all times."
    be "我不知道。正因为这样，我们才更要格外小心。从现在起，我会随身带着酒精喷雾。"

# game/script.rpy:17987
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_20d11294:

    # be "And we all need to make hygiene a priority, no exceptions."
    be "而且我们所有人都得把卫生放在第一位，一个都不能例外。"

# game/script.rpy:17988
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_ac1f7587:

    # vir "Got it... Doctor."
    vir "明白了……医生。"

# game/script.rpy:17989
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_3265040a:

    # be "More like... doctor's assistant."
    be "更准确地说……是医生助理。"

# game/script.rpy:17991
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_54fca50a:

    # wi "I just checked my ammo. I'm down to my last mag after yesterday's fight. Have you guys checked your ammo yet?"
    wi "我刚检查了弹药。昨天那场战斗打完，我只剩最后一个弹匣了。你们检查过自己的弹药了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:17993
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_ca856842:

    # be "I already checked. The gun you gave me, I only fired a few rounds yesterday."
    be "我检查过了。你给我的那把枪，我昨天只打了几发。"

# game/script.rpy:17995
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_8cc57b4b:

    # vir "My Glock has one spare mag, and I've got an assault rifle with backup ammo in the squad car outside."
    vir "我的格洛克还有一个备用弹匣，外面警车里还有一把突击步枪和备用弹药。"

# game/script.rpy:17996
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_1f7b3d1f:

    # vir "I was just thinking about going out to grab it."
    vir "我正想着出去把它拿进来。"

# game/script.rpy:17998
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_f35bd639:

    # wi "That's a good idea. I was thinking the same thing."
    wi "好主意，我也正想着这事。"

