translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_1c926b75:

    # vir "Then you're on your own. I don't know if any of your friends are still alive, but... I'm sorry if they're not."
    vir "那你就得靠自己了。我不知道你那些朋友还有没有活着的，但……如果他们没能撑下来，我很遗憾。"

# game/script.rpy:18029
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_7b8dc16c:

    # ren "Don't make me feel worse than I already do."
    ren "别让我心里更难受了。"

# game/script.rpy:18031
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_382861d8:

    # vir "I just want us to get along. We'll need to work together out there."
    vir "我只是希望我们能好好相处。外面我们得靠彼此合作才能活下去。"

