    vir "我信任你。"

# game/script.rpy:18039
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_79e77dd9:

    # be "I thought I'd pack some supplies in here, just in case things don't go as planned."
    be "我想着把一些物资打包放进这里，以防万一计划有变。"

# game/script.rpy:18040
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_e13af81e:

    # be "You know, emergency rations. So, officer, am I breaking any laws by taking this stuff?"
    be "你懂的，应急口粮之类的。所以，警官，我拿这些东西算违法吗？"

# game/script.rpy:18041
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_22072032:

    # vir "Technically, it's illegal. But not to me, not in times like these. Better to have a backup plan."
    vir "严格来说，是违法的。但对我来说不算，尤其是在这种时候。有备无患总是好的。"

# game/script.rpy:18042
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_7031a3b3:

    # be "This one's mostly food, but I still need to gather some medicine and other supplies."
    be "这一袋大多是食物，但我还得再收集一些药品和其他物资。"

# game/script.rpy:18044
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_904fe8a4:

    # ev "Will! Look what I found! A baseball bat! Guns make too much noise, so this'll be quieter. You could totally use it!"
    ev "威尔！你看我找到了什么！一根棒球棍！枪的声音太大了，这个安静多了。你完全可以用它！"

# game/script.rpy:18046
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_cd307819:

    # wi "Nice find! Where did you get this?"
    wi "找得不错！你从哪儿弄来的？"

# game/script.rpy:18047
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_55c3ef94:

    # ev "From the cabinet back there."
    ev "从后面那个柜子里。"

# game/script.rpy:18049
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_c011f3d7:

    # be "It's been a while since I've seen you with one of those, Will."
    be "好久没见你拿这种东西了，威尔。"

# game/script.rpy:18050
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_c3277091:

    # wi "I was terrible with it. Remember my last game? I cost us the championship."
    wi "我用得可差了。还记得我最后一场比赛吗？就是我把冠军搞丢的。"

# game/script.rpy:18052
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_ad8a52c4:

    # ev "Let me take a picture of you, Will!"
    ev "让我给你拍张照，威尔！"

# game/script.rpy:18053
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_bd5e91b9:

    # wi "You know how to take pictures?"
    wi "你还会拍照呢？"

# game/script.rpy:18055
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_786dcdab:

    # ev "Mom taught me. Plus, I just joined the photography club at school."
    ev "妈妈教过我。而且我刚加入了学校的摄影社。"

# game/script.rpy:18056
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_50eee4df:

    # ev "I was about to buy my own camera before, well..."
    ev "我本来打算买台自己的相机的，只是，唉……"

# game/script.rpy:18058
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_cd259cde:

    # ev "Hold still... and... smile!"
    ev "别动……然后……笑一个！"

