translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_42d16b7e:

    # ev "Guess we'll find out... after we develop the film."
    ev "等洗出来……就知道了。"

# game/script.rpy:18069
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_43e503ed:

    # re "Hey... I don't have a weapon. My shotgun's still out there."
    re "嘿……我没有武器。我的霰弹枪还落在外面呢。"

# game/script.rpy:18071
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_45f5e89d:

    # vir "I trust you... but I'm still not completely sure you won't stab me in the back if I hand you a weapon."
    vir "我信你……但把枪交给你之后，你会不会从背后捅我一刀，我不敢打包票。"

# game/script.rpy:18073
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_4f3455fb:

    # be "I think we should give her something. We could use the extra firepower."
    be "我觉得我们应该给她点武器。多一份火力总是好的。"

# game/script.rpy:18074
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_9bc9b26f:

    # be "If she turns on us, it won't help her either way."
    be "就算她反过来对付我们，对她也没什么好处。"

# game/script.rpy:18075
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_caf8ca03:

    # vir "Alright, alright, I said I trust her, didn't I?"
    vir "好了好了，我不是说了我信任她吗？"

