    be "我给路上准备了东西，食物、药品、必需品，以防万一计划有变。"

# game/script.rpy:18102
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_bab1a8e5:

    # wi "Those look heavy. Want me to carry one?"
    wi "这些看起来挺沉的。要我帮你拿一个吗？"

# game/script.rpy:18104
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_1da53e56:

    # be "I've got it. I'm not fragile, Will. Let me carry them, it's how I contribute."
    be "我拿得动。我又不是玻璃做的，威尔。让我来拿吧，这也是我出的一份力。"

# game/script.rpy:18105
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_10b11c67:

    # be "I've still got a few masks left. Let's wear them, better safe than sorry."
    be "我这儿还剩几个口罩。都戴上吧，小心为上。"

# game/script.rpy:18107
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_bfd091dc:

    # re "Yeah... not really my style."
    re "呃……不太是我的风格。"

# game/script.rpy:18109
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_e12f966a:

    # vir "Keep a spare for yourself. We can take care of ourselves."
    vir "自己留一个备用吧。我们能照顾好自己。"

# game/script.rpy:18111
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_9484bda1:

    # be "Suit yourselves. But if this virus works anything like what we saw... we should take every precaution."
    be "随你们便吧。但如果这病毒真跟我们见到的那样……我们就该做好一切防护。"

# game/script.rpy:18113
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_3b613cd9:

    # vir "Alright, short and simple. We head outside, clear the area, load up the truck, and make our way to The Empire Mall."
    vir "好了，长话短说。我们出去，清理周边，把车装满，然后前往帝国商场。"

# game/script.rpy:18114
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_0f6b323a:

    # vir "Beth, Evelyn, you two stay in the back. Sasha, watch their six. Will, Rhea, you're with me up front. We're the vanguard."
    vir "贝丝、伊芙琳，你们俩留在后面。萨莎，你负责掩护她们。威尔、瑞亚，跟我走在前面。我们是先锋。"

# game/script.rpy:18115
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_930a1c10:

    # wi "From what I saw yesterday, some of them can call others. If it starts screaming, take it out fast."
    wi "根据我昨天看到的，有些感染者会呼唤同类。要是它开始尖叫，赶紧解决掉。"

# game/script.rpy:18116
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_32787fb3:

    # wi "Don't go for the body, it slows them down, sure, but they can take pain. They can eat bullets. Aim for the head."
    wi "别打身体，那确实能拖慢它们，但它们不怕疼，吃几枪都没事。瞄准头部。"

# game/script.rpy:18117
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_4db8e15b:

    # vir "Sounds like your classic zombie rulebook. Head only, no mercy."
    vir "听起来就是经典的丧尸生存法则。只打头，不留情。"

# game/script.rpy:18118
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con_bd9c1053:

    # vir "That's it then. Everyone ready? Let's move."
    vir "那就这样。大家都准备好了吗？出发。"

