    # wi "I pissed her off."
    wi "我把她惹毛了。"

# game/script.rpy:18483
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_1cd73933:

    # be "What did you say to her?"
    be "你跟她说什么了？"

# game/script.rpy:18485
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_4c8b5139:

    # wi "I picked the wrong thing to say. Made her mad... and got kicked out."
    wi "我说错话了。把她惹生气了……然后就被赶走了。"

# game/script.rpy:18487
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_7f1cf8a5:

    # be "Figures. I knew it."
    be "早就猜到了。"

# game/script.rpy:18488
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_4d3d2c87:

    # be "Just give her space. She might calm down... or punch you again. Be ready for both."
    be "给她点空间吧。她可能会冷静下来……也可能再揍你一顿。两种情况都做好准备。"

# game/script.rpy:18490
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_e7cfed6c:

    # wi "Damn..."
    wi "该死……"

# game/script.rpy:18493
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_20e37a11:

    # wi "I don't know... I asked her to stick with us, but I don't think she'll stay long."
    wi "我不知道……我请她留下来跟我们一起，但我觉得她待不了多久。"

# game/script.rpy:18495
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_ee8df8ba:

    # be "Yeah, I figured. She seems hard to approach. Probably one of those stubborn bikers who doesn't trust people easily."
    be "嗯，我也这么想。她看起来不太好接近。可能是那种固执的摩托党，不轻易信任人。"

# game/script.rpy:18497
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_24f07f85:

    # wi "Yeah... and she won't stop talking about how much she hates cops."
    wi "是啊……而且她一直念叨她有多恨警察。"

# game/script.rpy:18498
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_a902d785:

    # wi "Especially now, when we have to work with one."
    wi "尤其现在我们还得跟一个警察合作。"

# game/script.rpy:18500
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_fa3e2247:

    # be "She's gonna be a problem, huh?"
    be "她会是个麻烦，是吧？"

# game/script.rpy:18502
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_e403d829:

    # wi "Only if we push her. Just let her be who she is. Maybe she'll come around."
    wi "只要我们不逼她就行。让她做她自己吧。也许她会慢慢想通的。"

# game/script.rpy:18505
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_de53ba85:

    # wi "Done with your vlog shoot with Virginia?"
    wi "跟弗吉尼亚的视频拍完了？"

# game/script.rpy:18507
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_46ab748c:

    # ev "Yeah, I'm done. I need to save the battery though. I forgot to charge it last night."
    ev "拍完了。不过我得省点电，昨晚忘了充电。"

# game/script.rpy:18509
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_b7758368:

    # wi "Wow, even pros forget to charge, huh?"
    wi "哇，连专业的都会忘记充电啊？"

# game/script.rpy:18511
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_697d0b06:

    # ev "I'm not a pro. Just trying to be a post-apocalypse influencer!"
    ev "我才不是专业的呢。我只是想当个末日网红！"

# game/script.rpy:18513
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_cba3173d:

    # wi "Well, you might actually make it. If you survive the zombies."
    wi "说不定你真能成呢。前提是你得先在丧尸手底下活下来。"

# game/script.rpy:18515
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_cd4fbf54:

    # ev "I'll survive... as long as you keep tanking for me!"
    ev "我会活下来的……只要你一直帮我挡着就行！"

# game/script.rpy:18517
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_fc5bfe7f:

    # wi "Great... I'm now a meat shield for an influencer."
    wi "太好了……我现在成网红的肉盾了。"

