    # vir "It should feed your rifle. Not perfect, but .223 works in a 5.56 chamber."
    vir "应该能给你的步枪用。不算完美，但.223口径在5.56的枪膛里能用。"

# game/script.rpy:18536
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_d081213c:

    # wi "Thanks. Really. That helps."
    wi "谢了，真的，帮大忙了。"

# game/script.rpy:18538
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_49868297:

    # vir "Yeah. I've got most of the 5.56 with me anyway."
    vir "没事，反正大部分5.56的弹药还在我这儿。"

# game/script.rpy:18539
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_8f435a2e:

    # vir "Sasha and I will take lead on the shooting. You focus on protecting your sister and Beth. Don't waste ammo unless you have to."
    vir "主要火力交给我和萨莎。你专心保护你妹妹和贝丝就行。不到万不得已别浪费弹药。"

# game/script.rpy:18541
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_bd6e0fdd:

    # wi "Got it. I'll keep them safe."
    wi "明白。我会保护好她们的。"

