    vir "嘿……我能问你点关于瑞亚的事吗？"

# game/script.rpy:18547
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_3c7f86ba:

    # vir "She's been tense. Defensive. I know she lost her crew, but... she's not exactly a team player."
    vir "她一直很紧张，充满防备心。我知道她失去了自己的团队，但……她确实不太会配合别人。"

# game/script.rpy:18548
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_459438a7:

    # vir "What did she say to you earlier? And... what do you really think of her?"
    vir "她之前跟你说了什么？还有……你真的怎么看她？"

