    extsasha "好了，大家都上车！出发！"

# game/script.rpy:18583
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_7bf89933:

    # be "You know, I've never actually wanted to sit in the back of a police car before. Kinda feels like I'm getting arrested."
    be "说真的，我以前从没想过要坐警车后座。感觉跟被逮捕了似的。"

# game/script.rpy:18584
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_0e2d2cfe:

    # ev "I didn't do anything wrong, I swear!"
    ev "我发誓我什么坏事都没做！"

# game/script.rpy:18585
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_ff690a5b:

    # extsasha "Don't worry. There's no law against zombie murder... yet. So you're clean. Get in."
    extsasha "别担心。杀丧尸目前还不犯法……至少现在还不算。所以你没事，上车吧。"

# game/script.rpy:18587
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_0ae9bcd0_14:

    # ""
    ""

# game/script.rpy:18589
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_66147a8e:

    # vir "Hey..."
    vir "嘿……"

# game/script.rpy:18591
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_732ceb28:

    # vir "Here. Thought this might help."
    vir "给，想着这个可能用得上。"

# game/script.rpy:18593
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_2099f1de:

    # re "You really trust me enough to give me shells?"
    re "你真的信任我到愿意给我子弹？"

# game/script.rpy:18595
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_3b1362e9:

    # vir "Look... I know we're not exactly on the same side. I don't know what you did or didn't do. All I got was a report. I followed it, I did my job."
    vir "听着……我知道我们不是一条战线上的人。我不知道你到底做过什么、没做过什么。我拿到的只是一份报告。我照着报告走，做了我该做的工作。"

# game/script.rpy:18597
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_190eb8c5:

    # re "That report... did it say anything about how those Cuban and Mexican assholes torched our clubhouse?"
    re "那份报告……有没有提到那些古巴和墨西哥的混蛋是怎么把我们俱乐部烧掉的？"

