# game/script.rpy:18607
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_d1f8dd54:

    # re "I brought my crew to Los Suenos to get away from that shit. I wanted a fresh start. No drugs, no guns, no underground."
    re "我把我的人带来洛斯苏埃诺斯，就是想逃离那些破事。我想要重新开始。不碰毒品，不碰枪，不涉黑。"

# game/script.rpy:18608
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_0f78919f:

    # re "Just bikes... Just riding every damn night. That's all I fucking wanted."
    re "就只想骑车……每晚骑车。这就是我他妈唯一想要的。"

# game/script.rpy:18611
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_649a7036:

    # re "But while I was gone, they came. They burned it all down. They killed my family. My people!"
    re "可我不在的时候，他们来了。他们把一切都烧了个精光。杀了我的家人。我的人！"

# game/script.rpy:18612
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_92e5cb9f:

    # re "They raped the ones who couldn't run fast enough. Took everything!"
    re "跑得不够快的都被他们强奸了。什么都被抢走了！"

# game/script.rpy:18614
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_d3cb696f:

    # re "And now..."
    re "现在……"

# game/script.rpy:18615
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_446ad650:

    # re "And now... this? You see what's left? This is it. This is all I've got."
    re "现在……就剩这个了？你看到剩下的了吗？就这些了。这就是我拥有的一切。"

# game/script.rpy:18616
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_148a3cda:

    # re "So I did what I had to. I led the ones who survived. We went after them, to make them pay."
    re "所以我做了我必须做的事。我带着活下来的人。我们去找他们算账。"

# game/script.rpy:18617
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_1d306e8d:

    # re "We were winning, damn it. Not a single one of us died... not until you people showed up."
    re "我们本来是占上风的，该死的。我们一个人都没死……直到你们这些人出现。"

# game/script.rpy:18618
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_7256defc:

    # re "You split us apart. And then... nothing. I never saw any of them again! Not one!"
    re "你们把我们打散了。然后……就什么都没了。我再也没见过他们中的任何一个！一个都没有！"

# game/script.rpy:18620
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_0ae9bcd0_19:

    # ""
    ""

# game/script.rpy:18622
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_a7c05555:

    # vir "I... I didn't know."
    vir "我……我不知道这些。"

# game/script.rpy:18624
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_0f811278:

    # re "Yeah. No one ever fucking knows."
    re "是啊。没人他妈的会知道。"

# game/script.rpy:18627
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_0ae9bcd0_20:

    # ""
    ""

# game/script.rpy:18629
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_6bfdd466:

    # re "You don't fucking know!"
    re "你他妈根本不知道！"

