translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_9103aa6f:

    # extsasha "7-Adam-11 calling The Empire Mall Command. Do you copy? This is 7-Adam-11. We're en route to your location. Please respond."
    extsasha "7-亚当-11呼叫帝国商场指挥部。收到请回答。这里是7-亚当-11。我们正在前往你们的位置。请回复。"

