    extsasha "帝国商场指挥部，这里是7-亚当-11。收到请回答。请确认你们的状态。"

# game/script.rpy:18764
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_0ae9bcd0_41:

    # ""
    ""

# game/script.rpy:18766
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_3ba19509:

    # extsasha "You sure about this, Virgie? That our people are actually there?"
    extsasha "你确定吗，弗吉？我们的人真的在那儿？"

# game/script.rpy:18768
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_9293f479:

    # vir "I made contact with them last night. SWAT and a few sheriffs were holding the line at The Empire Mall."
    vir "我昨晚跟他们联系上了。特警队和几个治安官在帝国商场守着防线。"

# game/script.rpy:18769
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_bdd7cfaf:

    # vir "That's what the Chief said before he... lost it."
    vir "那是局长在……失控之前说的。"

# game/script.rpy:18771
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_3388aafd:

    # extsasha "I just don't like silence on the radio. It never means anything good."
    extsasha "我就是不喜欢无线电里的沉默。这从来都不是什么好兆头。"

# game/script.rpy:18773
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_fb130011:

    # vir "Me neither. But it's all we've got right now."
    vir "我也不喜欢。但现在我们也只能靠这个了。"

# game/script.rpy:18775
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_0ce9d0c8:

    # be "No one's there?"
    be "那儿一个人都没有吗？"

# game/script.rpy:18776
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_904a39c5:

    # extsasha "I don't know. Could be their radio's down... or something worse."
    extsasha "不知道。可能是他们的无线电坏了……也可能是更糟的情况。"

# game/script.rpy:18777
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_8a65cd8f:

    # be "Last night the radio and internet were still working. But this morning, everything just went dead."
    be "昨晚无线电和网络都还能用。但今天早上，一切就都断了。"

# game/script.rpy:18779
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_345e8ba4:

    # ev "Wait, the internet worked last night!? Why didn't you tell me?!"
    ev "等等，昨晚网络能用！？你怎么没告诉我？！"

# game/script.rpy:18780
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_8a26aa08:

    # be "Yeah, just for a little while. I checked my feed, there was so much news about the outbreak. But then it just cut off at dawn."
    be "对，就一小会儿。我看了下我的推送，全是关于疫情爆发的消息。但天一亮就断了。"

# game/script.rpy:18782
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_46ca2327:

    # ev "I really wanted to post something on DikDok... or maybe call my friends. But... there's probably no one left to call now."
    ev "我本来特别想在DikDok上发点东西……或者给朋友们打个电话。但……现在可能已经没人能接了。"

# game/script.rpy:18784
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_a526634b:

    # ev "I just hope... they'll make it."
    ev "我只是希望……他们能挺过去。"

# game/script.rpy:18786
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_a39076a4:

    # ev "Ugh, still no signal... I just wanna watch something to kill time."
    ev "唉，还是没信号……我就是想看点东西打发时间。"

# game/script.rpy:18788
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_146d8a21:

    # extsasha "Kids these days can't survive without internet and DikDok, huh?"
    extsasha "现在的孩子没了网络和DikDok就活不下去了，是吧？"

# game/script.rpy:18790
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_631a5f4d:

    # ev "Hey! It's not just me, okay? Even Beth watches cat videos!"
    ev "嘿！又不是只有我这样，好吗？连贝丝都看猫咪视频呢！"

# game/script.rpy:18791
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_660264ec:

    # be "Only for the mental health benefits!"
    be "那是为了心理健康好吗！"

# game/script.rpy:18793
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_9cbbae1f:

    # extsasha "Virgie, didn't you say the signal worked last night and you got in touch with the Chief?"
    extsasha "弗吉，你不是说昨晚信号还能用，你还联系上局长了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:18795
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_84015d32:

    # vir "Yeah... He'd completely lost it. It was like he was high on that blue drug or something."
    vir "是啊……他已经彻底失控了。就跟嗑了那种蓝药似的。"

# game/script.rpy:18797
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_fe26c14b:

    # be "Blue drug? You mean {i}Synthozomethyl{/i}, right?"
    be "蓝药？你是说{i}合成唑甲基{/i}，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:18799
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_f3f0ad82:

    # vir "Yeah. Most people just call it {i}Syntrox{/i} or blue drug. It's been spreading in Los Suenos for almost a year."
    vir "对。大多数人都叫它{i}合成粉{/i}或者蓝药。这东西在洛斯苏埃诺斯已经流行了差不多一年了。"

# game/script.rpy:18800
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_387fc92b:

    # vir " I've arrested dozens smuggling it in from Mexico and South America."
    vir "我抓过好几十个从墨西哥和南美走私这玩意儿的人。"

# game/script.rpy:18802
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_1ac8fc00:

    # vir "Anyone high on that stuff acts just like what we're seeing now. Violence, screaming, biting..."
    vir "任何嗑了这玩意儿的人，表现都跟我们现在看到的一模一样。暴力、尖叫、咬人……"

# game/script.rpy:18803
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_a2ef80f9:

    # vir "Crime rates shot up like crazy. Mass shootings, armed robberies and gun violence are now everywhere in this country."
    vir "犯罪率疯狂飙升。大规模枪击、持械抢劫、枪支暴力，现在在这个国家到处都是。"

# game/script.rpy:18804
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_6b71636c:

    # vir "Los Suenos turned into a war zone. Cops were working nonstop. I got so many overtime bonuses I could've retired early and lived easy."
    vir "洛斯苏埃诺斯变成了一个战区。警察们不停歇地工作。我拿到的加班费多到都能提前退休、舒舒服服过日子了。"

# game/script.rpy:18806
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_ce4a15b8:

    # extsasha "That's why we get the good gear."
    extsasha "所以我们才能配到好装备。"

# game/script.rpy:18808
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_39e9d07b:

    # vir "And you, Beth? How's work at the hospital been?"
    vir "那你呢，贝丝？医院的工作怎么样？"

# game/script.rpy:18810
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_298b6b00:

    # be "Six months ago, I saw patients coming in with symptoms just like this... like real zombies."
    be "六个月前，我就见过病人带着这种症状进来……跟真正的丧尸一样。"

# game/script.rpy:18815
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_9c32b5fc:

    # bevo "There were so many overdoses. Some patients were just victims, others were violent, completely out of their minds. We even had shootings inside the hospital."
    bevo "有太多用药过量的病人了。有些只是受害者，有些则很暴力，完全失去理智。我们甚至在医院里遇到过枪击事件。"

# game/script.rpy:18818
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_cfbf03a6:

    # mane "Lemme go!"
    mane "放开我！"

# game/script.rpy:18820
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_985a65d0:

    # doc "Hold him still, Beth!"
    doc "按住他，贝丝！"

# game/script.rpy:18822
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_eb10f665:

    # be "I'm trying."
    be "我在尽力了。"

# game/script.rpy:18825
