    # ""
    ""

# game/script.rpy:18847
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_616e105b:

    # mane "Let me go!"
    mane "放开我！"

# game/script.rpy:18850
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_01c4fbee:

    # bevo "We lost so many doctors and nurses. Some were senior specialists... others were interns, barely a week in."
    bevo "我们失去了太多医生和护士。有些是资深专科医生……有些才刚实习不到一周。"

# game/script.rpy:18854
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_b3dffff0:

    # be "Some of those drugged up patients... they'd lash out, try to hurt staff. If they had a weapon, they'd use it. If not... sometimes they'd bite."
    be "有些嗑药的病人……会突然发狂，想伤害医护人员。有武器的话就用武器，没有的话……有时候就咬人。"

# game/script.rpy:18855
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_dac40539:

    # be "But the weird thing is... people who got bitten didn't show any signs of infection. Nothing."
    be "但奇怪的是……被咬的人完全没有出现感染的迹象。什么都没有。"

# game/script.rpy:18856
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_9856cf37:

    # be "So we thought it was just another violent drug case. Dangerous, yeah—but not contagious."
    be "所以我们当时以为只是又一起暴力吸毒案件。确实危险，但不会传染。"

# game/script.rpy:18858
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_c1615576:

    # vir "We had to post officers at hospitals, banks, schools... There weren't enough of us."
    vir "我们不得不在医院、银行、学校都安排警力……可我们的人手根本不够。"

# game/script.rpy:18860
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_72f61be1:

    # be "I didn't leave the hospital for a whole week. I'd nap for maybe two or three hours between emergencies. And there were no bonuses, just the same lousy paycheck."
    be "我整整一周没离开过医院。急诊之间能眯个两三个小时就不错了。而且一分奖金都没有，拿的还是那份可怜的工资。"

# game/script.rpy:18861
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_e38b41e5:

    # be "I finally got approved for a vacation. I thought I could finally relax... maybe go somewhere. Then this shitstorm hit."
    be "我的假期终于批下来了。我还以为总算能放松一下……说不定还能出去走走。结果这场鬼东西就来了。"

# game/script.rpy:18863
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_6d8e5b5f:

    # extsasha "Not so bad though, huh? At least you don't have to go back to that crappy job."
    extsasha "也没那么糟糕吧？至少你不用再回去做那份烂工作了。"

# game/script.rpy:18865
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_f7500bc3:

    # be "Yeah... maybe. But I didn't hate my job, you know? I loved being a nurse."
    be "是啊……也许吧。但我并不讨厌我的工作，你知道吗？我很喜欢当护士。"

# game/script.rpy:18867
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_21fd4f84:

    # wi "So... what's your actual job, Beth? Are you a nurse or a doctor's assistant?"
    wi "那……你到底是干什么的，贝丝？你是护士还是医生助理？"

# game/script.rpy:18869
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_1c2a71e4:

    # be "To be honest, I originally applied to be a doctor's assistant."
    be "说实话，我一开始应聘的是医生助理。"

# game/script.rpy:18870
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_7b761077:

    # be "But after the whole Syntrox epidemic, we were so understaffed that I ended up doing both."
    be "但自从合成粉疫情爆发之后，我们人手严重不足，结果两份工作我都得干。"

# game/script.rpy:18871
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_dc200ea7:

    # be "It was insane. One minute I'm handing tools to a surgeon, next I'm stitching up wounds or running the ER."
    be "简直疯狂。前一分钟我还在给外科医生递工具，下一分钟就得去缝合伤口或者管理急诊室。"

