    # extsasha "I'm not fucking around, bitch!"
    extsasha "老娘没跟你闹着玩，贱人！"

# game/script.rpy:19074
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_03886333:

    # extsasha "Say the word, Virginia. I'll fucking end her right now. Just say it!"
    extsasha "你说一句话，弗吉尼亚。我现在就他妈结果她。你就说一句！"

# game/script.rpy:19076
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_257ab0b7:

    # re "Fuck off. I ain't talking to you. This ain't your story, rookie."
    re "滚开。我没跟你说话。这事跟你没关系，菜鸟。"

# game/script.rpy:19078
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_ddc8790b:

    # re "You wanna know what it's like to lose everything? To watch your family burn, your crew fall apart, one by fucking one? I'll show you."
    re "你想知道失去一切是什么感觉吗？眼看着家人被烧死，团队一个接一个他妈的散掉？我让你尝尝。"

# game/script.rpy:19080
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_bab8ef98:

    # re "I'll blow her fucking head off and let you feel what I feel!"
    re "我要把她的脑袋他妈的炸开花，让你也尝尝我的感受！"

# game/script.rpy:19082
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_6e282c3c:

    # vir "Rhea. Don't. You're better than this. We've all lost people... but if you pull that trigger, it's over. For all of us."
    vir "瑞亚。别这样。你不是这种人。我们都失去过人……但如果你扣下扳机，一切就都完了。对我们所有人来说都是。"

