    re "你他妈根本不懂街头是什么样子。不懂失去所有你在乎的人是什么感觉！"

# game/script.rpy:19100
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_9b1bf4ed:

    # vir "I've lost people too. Don't fucking act like pain only belongs to you."
    vir "我也失去过人。别他妈表现得好像只有你才懂得痛苦。"

# game/script.rpy:19102
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_2b16dc6f:

    # wi "Stop it! All of you!"
    wi "都住手！你们所有人！"

# game/script.rpy:19103
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_cc58ddc3:

    # be "Are you seriously going to shoot each other now?! This isn't the time for this!"
    be "你们现在真要互相开枪吗？！现在不是干这个的时候！"

# game/script.rpy:19105
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_0ae9bcd0_99:

    # ""
    ""

# game/script.rpy:19109
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_dc775658:

    # wi "Rhea, you're right. You've lost more than any of us. I don't blame you for being angry."
    wi "瑞亚，你说得对。你失去的比我们任何人都多。我不怪你生气。"

# game/script.rpy:19110
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_bdf2659f:

    # wi "I get it. You're not just angry, you're broken inside. If I saw someone I loved lying there... I'd probably do the same."
    wi "我明白。你不只是生气，你的内心已经碎了。如果是我看到自己爱的人倒在那儿……我可能也会这么做。"

# game/script.rpy:19113
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_0ae9bcd0_100:

    # ""
    ""

# game/script.rpy:19117
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_2ad5d855:

    # wi "Rhea, stop!"
    wi "瑞亚，住手！"

# game/script.rpy:19118
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_4a7c10aa:

    # wi "You're pointing a gun at the one person who's kept us all from falling apart."
    wi "你正拿枪指着那个一直在维系我们所有人、不让我们分崩离析的人。"

# game/script.rpy:19119
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_601a92fb:

    # wi "She's not perfect, sure—but she did her job. In a city falling to shit. And she did it damn well."
    wi "她不完美，这我承认——但她尽了自己的职责。在一座正在崩溃的城市里，她做得他妈的相当不错。"

# game/script.rpy:19120
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_20a8df56:

    # wi "I get that you're angry... but pointing a gun at someone isn't gonna bring your friend back, is it?"
    wi "我理解你在生气……但拿枪指着别人也不能让你的朋友活过来，不是吗？"

# game/script.rpy:19121
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_cf5107d6:

    # wi "We've all lost something. But if you pull that trigger, Rhea... the new life you wanted? It's gone."
    wi "我们都失去过一些东西。但如果你扣下扳机，瑞亚……你想要的新生活？就彻底没了。"

# game/script.rpy:19124
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_0ae9bcd0_101:

    # ""
    ""

# game/script.rpy:19128
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_1efd44d2:

    # wi "That's enough! Just stop!"
    wi "够了！都住手！"

# game/script.rpy:19129
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_50f73381:

    # wi "We made it this far just to start shooting each other? This isn't your personal war!"
    wi "我们好不容易走到今天，就是为了互相开枪吗？这不是你的私人战争！"

# game/script.rpy:19131
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_6c522531:

    # wi "Rhea lost her people. You too Virginia and everything she stood for. We're all carrying weight."
    wi "瑞亚失去了她的人。弗吉尼亚也是，还有她所坚守的一切。我们每个人身上都背着重担。"

# game/script.rpy:19133
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_533a7c93:

    # wi "But if we start turning our guns on each other... then all those who died? They died for nothing!"
    wi "但如果我们开始互相拿枪指着对方……那些已经死去的人呢？他们就白死了！"

# game/script.rpy:19136
