# game/script.rpy:19697
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_4c92d7e7:

    # vir "Wait... everyone's dead?"
    vir "等等……大家都死了？"

# game/script.rpy:19699
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_52740a3a:

    # extge "Yeah... except me. {i}Officer Craig{/i} here saved me. We hid until things calmed down."
    extge "是啊……除了我。{i}克莱格警官{/i}救了我。我们一直躲着，直到情况稳定下来。"

# game/script.rpy:19701
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_ef8ff944:

    # extcrag "It all happened so fast. People panicked and rushed to evacuate here... total chaos. We couldn't control it."
    extcrag "一切发生得太快了。人们惊慌失措，都涌到这儿来撤离……彻底一片混乱。我们根本控制不住。"

# game/script.rpy:19703
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_ee0d67a9:

    # vir "I saw some of them hobbling this way just half an hour ago."
    vir "我半小时前还看到有几个丧尸一瘸一拐地朝这边走来。"

# game/script.rpy:19705
