    extcrag "我们还是没法到楼顶停车场……太危险了。"

# game/script.rpy:19706
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_813f00d7:

    # extcrag "There's a long-range radio up there. If we can reach it, maybe we can send a distress signal to the military and request extraction."
    extcrag "那上面有一台远程无线电。如果我们能到那儿，也许能向军方发送求救信号，请求撤离。"

# game/script.rpy:19708
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_631c39ac:

