    # vir "Our policy was clear, never take off armor while on duty."
    vir "我们的规定很明确，执勤时绝不能脱下防弹衣。"

# game/script.rpy:20703
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_8ca4150e:

    # extge "Yeah, well... I got shot, so I had to."
    extge "是啊，可是……我中枪了，不得不脱。"

# game/script.rpy:20704
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_dd7ab781:

    # extge "Most of us didn't die from the infected. We died because we shot each other."
    extge "我们大多数人不是死在感染者手里的。是我们自己人开枪打死了自己人。"

# game/script.rpy:20706
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_82e91b56:

    # vir "What do you mean, shot each other?"
    vir "什么意思，自相残杀？"

# game/script.rpy:20709
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_472833d6:

    # extge "Some of us... went crazy. Just like Sasha."
    extge "我们中有些人……疯了。就跟萨莎一样。"

# game/script.rpy:20710
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_45f45116:

    # extge "When the horde stormed in, panic broke out, and we ended up turning our guns on each other. That's why it's a bloodbath."
    extge "那群感染者冲进来的时候，大家都吓疯了，结果我们自己人开枪打了起来。这就是为什么这儿变成了一片血海。"

# game/script.rpy:20711
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_b68bb242:

    # extge "Really lost my self-esteem... just Sasha alone wrecked us this bad. And Craig, someone we trusted, she killed him."
    extge "我的自尊心真是碎了一地……光萨莎一个人就把我们害惨成这样。还有克莱格，我们信任的人，也被她杀了。"

# game/script.rpy:20713
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_b85d7aef:

    # wi "She disarmed me completely, and with just one elbow strike, lights out for me."
    wi "她把我的武器完全缴了，一记肘击就让我直接昏过去了。"

# game/script.rpy:20715
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_c9e62cb5:

    # vir "After the Blue Drug outbreak in Los Suenos, crime skyrocketed. Sasha figured she had to toughen up, so she trained harder."
    vir "自从蓝药在洛斯苏埃诺斯泛滥以来，犯罪率飙升。萨莎觉得自己得变得更强，所以训练得更刻苦。"

# game/script.rpy:20716
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_5da92cd1:

    # vir "And lately, lots of ex-special forces have been joining the LSPD after discharge."
    vir "而且最近，不少退役特种部队的人都加入了洛斯苏埃诺斯警局。"

# game/script.rpy:20718
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_ea0de6d4:

    # wi "That explains a lot."
    wi "这就说得通了。"

