# game/script.rpy:21641
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_0c053b58:

    # ev "I just wanna go home. I wanna lie in bed and scroll DikDok all day, doing nothing."
    ev "我只想回家。我想躺在床上一整天刷DikDok，什么都不做。"

# game/script.rpy:21645
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_7e6b7724:

    # wi "Don't get your hopes up just yet."
    wi "先别抱太大希望。"

# game/script.rpy:21647
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_673df01f:

    # ev "Come on... let me hope a little. I just wanna go home."
    ev "拜托……让我抱点希望嘛。我只是想回家。"

# game/script.rpy:21649
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_3e2ae742:

    # wi "Our home's not going anywhere. First, we survive. When it's all over, we'll go back."
    wi "家又不会跑。我们先活下来。等这一切结束了，我们就回去。"

# game/script.rpy:21651
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_085a1dd2:

    # ev "Then I'll wait for that day."
    ev "那我就等着那一天。"

