# game/script.rpy:21664
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_3261c8b8:

    # be "H-hey, come on... this guy? He can only ever be a friend, that's all!"
    be "喂、喂，别这样……这家伙？他只能是朋友，仅此而已！"

# game/script.rpy:21666
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_0ae9bcd0_514:

    # ""
    ""

# game/script.rpy:21668
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_2e505810:

    # be "Anyway... let's go see who Virginia managed to get in touch with."
    be "总之……我们去看看弗吉尼亚联系上了谁。"

# game/script.rpy:21670
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_0ae9bcd0_515:

    # ""
    ""

# game/script.rpy:21673
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_2391562b:

    # vir "This is the LSPD evac center... anyone there?"
    vir "这里是洛斯苏埃诺斯警局撤离中心……有人在吗？"

# game/script.rpy:21676
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_97e24fe4:

    # re "Enough... it's dead silent. That damn helicopter's probably long gone."
    re "够了……死一般的寂静。那该死的直升机估计早就飞远了。"

# game/script.rpy:21678
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_5ce6f491:

    # vir "Yeah... that chopper we saw? It's not coming back. The military marked this city as no-fly zone."
    vir "是啊……我们看到的那架直升机？它不会回来了。军方把这座城市划成了禁飞区。"

# game/script.rpy:21679
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_83fe1105:

    # vir "I just want to know where they evacuated to."
    vir "我只是想知道他们撤到哪儿去了。"

# game/script.rpy:21681
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_6be1977c:

    # vir "Look at this... we've lost all the big cities. Seems like they went to the spots marked here."
    vir "你看这个……我们已经失去了所有大城市。看起来他们撤到了图上标出的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:21683
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_9a181076:

    # re "Heh... you're fucking hopelessly optimistic. Half the world's gone to shit, and you still think someone's waiting to save us?"
    re "嘿……你他妈也太乐观了吧。半个世界都完蛋了，你还觉得有人在等着救我们？"

# game/script.rpy:21685
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_cf86fbb7:

    # be "Did you manage to contact anyone?"
    be "你联系上什么人了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:21687
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_d5c72437:

    # vir "Not a thing. The only lead we have is the area marked on this map."
    vir "什么都没有。我们唯一的线索就是这张地图上标出的区域。"

# game/script.rpy:21689
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_4fb94527:

    # wi "Hop off for a bit, I need to talk to them."
    wi "先下去一下，我得跟他们谈谈。"

# game/script.rpy:21691
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_fff91d9c:

    # vir "Will... I think we should try talking to the soldiers. Do you think they'd be able to get us out of here?"
    vir "威尔……我觉得我们应该试着跟那些士兵谈谈。你觉得他们能带我们离开这儿吗？"

# game/script.rpy:21693
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_f1cf339d:

    # re "I don't think so."
    re "我可不这么认为。"

# game/script.rpy:21695
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_0ae9bcd0_516:

    # ""
    ""

# game/script.rpy:21699
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_1e908a67:

    # wi "They'll get us out for sure."
    wi "他们肯定能带我们出去。"

# game/script.rpy:21701
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_92b2df78:

    # vir "You really think so? I hope you're right..."
    vir "你真这么想？希望你是对的……"

# game/script.rpy:21703
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_22db5624:

    # re "Ha! That's some optimism for you. Don't get your hopes up too high."
    re "哈！你可真乐观。别抱太大希望。"

# game/script.rpy:21707
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_d1990166:

    # wi "They're special forces. We're not part of their mission, but I can try to talk to them and see if they can help."
    wi "他们是特种部队。我们不在他们的任务范围内，但我可以试着跟他们谈谈，看能不能帮上忙。"

# game/script.rpy:21709
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_71baa73c:

    # vir "Hmm... that might be our best shot then."
    vir "嗯……那也许是我们最好的机会了。"

# game/script.rpy:21711
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_df42f3c3:

    # re "Heh... fine. But if they blow us off, don't cry later."
    re "嘿……行吧。但要是他们不理咱们，别到时候哭鼻子。"

# game/script.rpy:21714
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_8778a4b4:

    # be "We can't just wait here forever. What if the soldiers don't help us?"
    be "我们不能一直在这儿干等着。万一那些士兵不肯帮我们呢？"

# game/script.rpy:21716
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_3310d757:

    # re "Then we take matters into our own hands. I don't care if it's risky. We fight our way out."
    re "那我们就自己动手。管它多冒险。我们杀出一条血路。"

# game/script.rpy:21718
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_790af375:

    # vir "It's not that simple, Rhea. We can't just go charging into a city full of infected. We need a plan."
    vir "没那么简单，瑞亚。我们不能就这么冲进一座满是感染者的城市。我们得有个计划。"

# game/script.rpy:21720
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_e00541ed:

    # be "Virginia's right. We have to think. But we can't just stand around waiting either."
    be "弗吉尼亚说得对。我们得好好想想。但我们也不能就这么干站着等。"

# game/script.rpy:21722
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_033d9942:

    # exteai "Where are those soldiers? Why didn't they come up? They were supposed to evacuate me! Where's the helicopter?"
    exteai "那些士兵在哪儿？他们怎么还没上来？他们本该撤离我的！直升机在哪儿？"

# game/script.rpy:21724
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_4c9c629a:

    # exteai "I can't reach anyone! Damn it!"
    exteai "我联系不上任何人！该死！"

# game/script.rpy:21726
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_51672ef7:

    # exteai "Officer! What the hell happened? The police set up an evacuation center here. Why is everything such a mess?"
    exteai "警官！这里到底发生了什么？警方在这儿设立了撤离中心。怎么会乱成这样？"

# game/script.rpy:21728
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_bf79a2dc:

    # vir "I don't know, ma'am. I just arrived this morning."
    vir "我不知道，女士。我今天早上才到。"

# game/script.rpy:21730
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_4ea76831:

    # exteai "This is a complete failure of duty!"
    exteai "这完全是失职！"

# game/script.rpy:21732
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_aec78ed8:

    # vir "I'm sorry, ma'am, if I failed to meet your expectations."
    vir "很抱歉，女士，如果我没能达到您的期望。"

# game/script.rpy:21734
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_a8d30686:

    # re "And what about you? What's your role in all this?"
    re "那你呢？你在这一切里又算什么角色？"

# game/script.rpy:21736
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_1e9ff4bd:

    # exteai "I ordered the evacuation centers to be set up. I commanded transportation to stop and organized buses and school vehicles to evacuate tens of thousands."
    exteai "是我下令设立撤离中心的。我下令停运交通，组织了大巴和校车撤离了成千上万的人。"

# game/script.rpy:21738
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_ca3776b7:

    # exteai "But with no communication, nothing worked. I tried to have every agency make announcements, but no one followed protocol."
    exteai "但通讯全断了，什么都行不通。我试过让每个部门都发布公告，但没人遵守规程。"

# game/script.rpy:21739
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_c3ef8014:

    # exteai "Everything fell apart. I called every department—police, sheriff, Homeland Security, army, navy, air force, marines... all night."
    exteai "一切都分崩离析了。我给每个部门都打过电话——警察、治安官、国土安全部、陆军、海军、空军、海军陆战队……打了一整晚。"

# game/script.rpy:21740
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_968533bd:

    # exteai "My phone's battery almost died, and I didn't sleep a second!"
    exteai "我的手机电量都快耗尽了，我一秒钟都没睡！"

# game/script.rpy:21742
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_77a1b5dd:

    # re "Tch..."
    re "切……"

# game/script.rpy:21744
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_2dd9d72c:

    # be "She says she hasn't slept, but her makeup's perfect..."
    be "她说自己没睡，可妆容却完美无瑕……"

# game/script.rpy:21746
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_1a6c9788:

    # re "Hey... I've got some weed. Want some? Might help you relax."
    re "嘿……我这儿有点大麻。要来点吗？说不定能让你放松放松。"

# game/script.rpy:21748
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_5cdcfa7c:

    # exteai "Ahhh! I hate this place!"
    exteai "啊啊啊！我讨厌这个地方！"

# game/script.rpy:21750
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_cc577845:

    # exteai "Where are the soldiers? Why haven't they come up yet?"
    exteai "士兵们在哪儿？他们怎么还没上来？"

# game/script.rpy:21752
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_92e7a96c:

    # sol "We're here. Cleared the deaths. Nothing left to follow up now."
    sol "我们到了。死者已经清理完了。没有别的后续了。"

# game/script.rpy:21754
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_b9429d9d:

