# game/script.rpy:21922
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_42479081:

    # ire "Okay, listen. From what I've heard, the army evacuated north, towards Washington. Try to avoid any evacuation centers or military base."
    ire "好，听着。据我所知，军队正朝北撤往华盛顿方向。尽量避开任何撤离中心或军事基地。"

# game/script.rpy:21923
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_26fee7c8:

    # ire "Find somewhere safe outside the city. I don't know what might happen."
    ire "在城外找个安全的地方。我不知道接下来会发生什么。"

# game/script.rpy:21924
translate Chinese po02_02_sto_con2_57829ae5:

    # ire "And hey, keep your phone on, you idiot. If it's the same number, keep it on, I'll reach out if there's any update."
    ire "还有，嘿，把手机开着，你这个笨蛋。如果号码没变，就一直开着，有消息我会联系你的。"

